"P3229109842" "Howling Twilight"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P205558678" "Ranged (AoE), Minor DMG(Negative), Target Slow, -Recharge, -Regen, Disorient, Ally Rez"
// Power Help Text :
"P852421223" "Activating this power channels the power of the Netherworld to weaken your foes, in an attempt to revive all nearby fallen allies. You must stand near your defeated allies to revive them, then select a foe. The selected foe and all nearby foes will be Slowed, Disoriented, have their Regeneration rate reduced and drained of some life. Revived allies will have full Hit Points and Endurance and will be protected from XP Debt for 90 seconds. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2728479627" "Your {PowerName} reduced the attack rate and movement speed of {PlayerDest}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2669148710" "-Recharge, -SPD, Disorient"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P181463503" "You have been Disoriented.  Your Attack rate and Running speed are reduced by the Howling Twilight."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P713892034" "You disorient {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3202947871" "{PlayerSource} disorients you with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shadow Fall 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2272064692" "Shadow Fall"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4241292887" "Toggle: PBAoE, Team Stealth, +DEF(All), +Res(Energy, Negative, Psionics, Fear)"
// Power Help Text :
"P890111217" "Envelops you and your nearby teammates in a shroud of darkness. Shadow Fall does not grant Invisibility, but it does make you harder to detect. Even if you are discovered, Shadow Fall grants a bonus to Defense bonus to all attacks and Resistance to Fear, while reducing Energy, Negative Energy, and Psionic Damage. You cannot use any other Concealment type power while using Shadow Fall. Recharge: Slow"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1493333783" "You are hidden within the Shadow Fall."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2430370769" "Stealth, +DEF(All), +Res(Energy, Negative, Psionics, Fear))"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2614214872" "Shadow Fall has made you difficult to detect, which increases your Defense.  Shadowfall also partially absorbs and deflects Energy, Negative Energy and Psionic damage. You are also less fearful."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3932635806" "Fade"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1651580691" "PBAoE Team, +Defense(All), +Res(Defense Debuffs)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2643352247" "You partially bring yourself and all nearby teammates into the Netherworld vastly increasing their Defense to all attacks for a very short period of time as well as increasing their resistance to Defense Debuffs. This power is best used to help counter a dangerous situation. Recharge: Very Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2204198363" "+Def(All), +Res(Defense Debuffs)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3415482398" "Your defense has been dramatically increased for a short time by Fade."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Soul Absorption 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2527135791" "Soul Absorption"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2553463058" "PBAoE Team +Regen, +Recovery (Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1005844290" "You drain the remaining essence of nearby defeated foes to cause you and your allies to regenerate and recovery much more quickly. The more defeated foes affected, the more powerful the regeneration and recovery effect will be. Recharge: Very Slow."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1409564616" "Your {PowerName} siphons essence from nearby defeated foes to cause you and your team to regenerate health and recover endurance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Black Hole 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P801416744" "Black Hole"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P36099885" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Intangible"
// Power Help Text :
"P140060975" "Opens up a Black Hole to the Netherworld that temporarily pulls in all foes within its grasp. The victims become phase shifted and are completely intangible. They are hard to see, and cannot affect or be affected by those in normal space. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4032697821" "Intangible"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2861448899" "You have been sucked into a Black Hole.  You cannot affect or be affected by anyone in your vicinity."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3946614762" "You pull {PlayerDest} into another dimension making them intangible."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1631193337" "{PlayerSource} sucks you into a {PowerName} making you intangible!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1325279438" "You pull {PlayerDest} into another dimension.  He is now intangible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Servant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1851218085" "Dark Servant"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2290037222" "Summon Dark Servant: Ranged Debuff Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P771199714" "Summons a Dark Servant to your aid. The Dark Servant possesses an assortment of dark powers to weaken your foes. The summoned entity is not a willing servant, and it is only your power that binds it in this realm.  The Dark Servant can be buffed and healed. Recharge: Very Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
