// DisplayName :
"P2457338166" "Empathy"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2304849589" "Empathy gives you the ability to heal and aid allies as well as yourself.  Empathy has no offensive powers, but its heals and buffs are unmatched."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Siphon Energy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2121818994" "Healing Aura"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1906443399" "PBAoE, Team +Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P1027827377" "Healing Aura restores some Hit Points to you and all nearby heroes. Healing Aura is not as potent as Heal Other, but can heal multiple targets at once. Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1645239844" "You heal {PlayerDest} {Damage} points of damage."
