// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P553708814" "Ally Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P504846955" "Heals a single targeted ally. You cannot use this power to heal yourself. Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Absorb Pain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P177315034" "Absorb Pain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3000415524" "Ally Strong Heal, Self Moderate DMG(Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2797803543" "Dramatically heals an ally's wounds. This power has only a tiny Endurance cost, but it requires you to sacrifice some of your Hit Points. Absorbing someone's pain can be quite dramatic, and afterwards you will be briefly unable to heal your own wounds by any means. Recharge: Slow"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P264829216" "You Absorb {Damage} points of damage and you are unable to heal for a brief while."

