"P67400177" "Ranged, Ally +End, +Regeneration, +Recharge, Res (Slow)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1459528881" "Dramatically increases an ally's Endurance Recovery, Hit Point Regeneration and attack rate for 90 seconds. Also grants the target high resistance to slow effects. Recharge: Very Long"
