"P2814703278" "You empower {PlayerDest} with dramatically increased Endurance Recovery, Hit Point Regeneration and attack rate."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3796200085" "{PlayerSource} empowers you with dramatically increased Endurance Recovery, Hit Point Regeneration and attack rate."
