// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Increase Density 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3687435012" "Increase Density"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1601178268" "Ranged, Ally Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P642054627" "Increases an ally's mass, freeing them from any Disorient, Immobilization, or Hold effects and leaving them resistant to such effects for a while. Increase Density also protects the target from Knockback, Repel and enemy Teleportation, as well as Smashing and Energy damage. Because the target grows more dense, their movement speed is Slowed. Although the Damage Resistance and slowing effect will not stack with multiple applications, the rest of the effects of Increase Density will. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1924523378" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Holds, Immobilization, Disorient, Knockback, Repel and enemy Teleportation, as well as smashing and energy damage with your {PowerName} power."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3719467599" "{PlayerSource} protect you from Holds, Immobilization, Disorient, Knockback, Repel, and enemy Teleportation, as well as smashing and energy damage"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1228522254" ""+Res(Special)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1912899325" "Your Resistance to Smashing and Energy attacks has been increased.  You are more resistant to Hold, Disorient, Immobilize, Knockback, Repel and enemy Teleport attacks, but your movement rates are slightly reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Speed Boost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3686758356" "Speed Boost"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P146937202" "Ranged, Ally +SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, Res Slow"
// Power Help Text :
"P553862191" "You can hasten a single targeted ally. The target's movement speed, attack rate, and Endurance recovery are all greatly increased and the target gains resistance to Slow effects. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1930511113" "You {PowerName} {PlayerDest}, greatly increasing their movement rate, attack rate and endurance recovery!"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2717324833" "{PlayerSource} improves your movement rate, attack rate and endurance recovery with an extra {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P922167688" "+SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, Res Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1810162801" "You've been granted a Speed Boost.  Your Attack speed, Endurance recovery and Running speed are all increased and you are resistant to Slow effects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Inertial Reduction 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4081596977" "Inertial Reduction"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3810722637" "PBAoE, Allies +Jump"
// Power Help Text :
"P1170626945" "You can reduce your Inertia, along with that of all nearby allies. The affected heroes can then jump incredible distances for a while. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2870689215" "Your {PowerName} allows you to jump incredible distances!"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1925169516" "{PlayerSource} reduces your inertia temporarily, allowing you to jump incredible distances!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1459003196" "+Jump"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2340966442" "Your inertia has been reduced, allowing you to make incredible leaps."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Transference 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1682568980" "Transference"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3030858431" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Target -End, Team +Recovery, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3286788869" "Transference drains an enemy of some of their Endurance and transfers that Endurance to all allies near the affected foe. You can use Transference to recover Endurance for yourself as well as your allies. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P496142339" "-Endurance"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1231917684" "Your Endurance has been drained."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1430421884" "You Siphon the endurance of {PlayerDest} to add to the endurance of everyone near them!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4254768236" "{PlayerSource} siphons off your endurance to increase the endurance of all their allies near you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Kinetic Transfer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3140221556" "Fulcrum Shift"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3575358054" "Ranged (Foe AoE), Foe -DMG, Team +DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P214563523" "Fulcrum Shift drains the power of a targeted foe and all foes nearby, transferring it to all adjacent allies, the caster, and those near the caster. Affected foes will deal less damage, while your affected allies will deal more. The more foes that are affected, the more power your allies receive. Fulcrum Shift can dramatically turn the tide of a melee battle. Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1373021045" "Your {PowerName} reduces the damage capability of {PlayerDest}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P150686789" "{PlayerSource} reduces your damage capability with their {PowerName}!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Poison 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P4275575935" "Poison"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2841584505" "You are a master of Poison and can concoct a variety of venoms and toxins allowing you to weaken your enemies.  When used correctly, some Poisons can even be used to aid your allies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Alkaloid 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3338218470" "Alkaloid"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P192217088" "Ally Heal, +Res(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P633752156" "When used correctly, poisons can be used to heal, as well as harm.  Alkaloid consists of just the right amount of amino acids to safely heal a single targeted ally. The healed target is also left with some resistance to Toxic Damage (This Toxic Damage Resistance cannot be Enhanced). You cannot use this power to heal yourself. Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1198011080" "You heal {PlayerDest} {Damage} points of damage and improve their resistance to Toxic Damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P711986937" "{PlayerSource} heals you for {Damage} points of damage and improves you resistance to Toxic Damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Envenom 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1357149555" "Envenom"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2033004693" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -RES, -DEF, -Regen, -Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P4054932572" "You Envenom your foe with a nasty poison, the poison then spreads to nearby foes.  The toxin directly attacks the immune system, reducing the affected target's Defense, Damage Resistance and Hit Point Regeneration Rate.  The poison is so potent, that the target actually responds less to Healing while affected by the poison.   Secondary foes struck by this power will have a lesser effect placed on them while the primary target receives the full effectiveness of the power.  Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2132842561" "You Envenom {PlayerDest} and reduced their Defense and Damage Resistance and Regeneration."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P4263359596" "{PlayerSource} reduces your Defense, Damage Resistance and Regeneration with their {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1511201118" "-RES, -DEF, -Regen, -Heal"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3705153969" "Your Defense, Damage Resistances and Regeneration have been reduced.  You also Heal less from Heal powers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Weaken 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2214790859" "Weaken"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3098322516" "Ranged (Targeted AoE) Foe -DMG -To Hit, -Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P4153236241" "You poison a single foe with a venom that significantly Weakens their strength and and that of nearby foes.   The affected primary target's chance to hit and Damage output is severely reduced Additionally, the affected targets secondary power effects are all weakened. The targets power effects like Heals, Defense Buffs, Endurance Drains, Disorients, Holds, Immobilizes, Knockbacks and more, are all weakened.  Secondary foes struck by this power will have a lesser effect placed on them while the primary target receives the full effectiveness of the power.  Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4213374470" "You Weaken {PlayerDest} and reduce their chance to hit, damage and power effects."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1094182561" "{PlayerSource} reduces your chance to hit, Damage and power effects with their {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1749202183" "-To Hit, -DMG, -Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P870938078" "Your chance to hit and Damage potential and power effects have all been reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Neurotoxic Breath 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1837006782" "Neurotoxic Breath"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P413475405" "You can breath a cone of Neurotoxin gas that quickly start to anesthetize any nearby foes.  Affected targets may choke on the gas as their movement and attack rate are severely reduced. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P706922686" "Your {PowerName} dramatically Slows the attack speed and movement of {PlayerDest}"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3646837205" "{PlayerSource} Slows you with their {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3697806060" "You are choking on Neurotoxic gas.  Your attack rate and movement speed are reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Elixir of Life 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2164945405" "Elixir of Life"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2944072660" "Close, Ally Rez, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2036775056" "With this Elixir, you can revive a fallen ally and turn him into a killing machine. The revived target has increased damage, chance to hit, Endurance recovery, and attack speed, and gains a resistance to Toxic damage. A brew of this sort is not without its side effects. The revived target will soon become very sick and severely weak after about 90 seconds. All effects of the Elixir will eventually wear off. Elixir of Life can only be used on Players and cannot be used on your Henchmen.  Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayConfirm :
"P2987816183" "{PlayerSource} would like to Resurrect you.  You will have full Health and Endurance and be extremely powerful for a while, but will weaken after 90 seconds. Do you Accept?"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4150946459" "Your have been saved by the Elixir of Life.  Your chance to hit and attack rate are improved. Your damage and Endurance recovery are increased as well and you gain a resistance to Toxic damage.  You are also protected from XP Debt for 90 seconds. The experience is taxing however, and you will soon weaken when all of the effects of the Elixir wear off."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2180373901" "You give {PlayerDest} your Elixir of Life and revive them returning {Damage} points of health."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1078120874" "{PlayerSource} returns you from the brink of death and heals you for {Damage} points of damage with an Elixir of Life. For a while, the Elixir has increased strength, but it will wears off fast, and you will be become sick and weak in about 90 seconds."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3379169905" "Your Elixir has worn off, and you are now sick and weakened."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Antidote 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3729372453" "Antidote"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1579801539" "Ally +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Confuse, Fear, Slow, Cold, Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1204937636" "This Antidote can free an ally from any Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Slow, Confuse, Fear and Immobilize effects and leaves them resistant to such effects for a good while. The Antidote also grants the target some resistance to Cold and Toxic damage. Some of the effects of this power will improve with Multiple applications and as you advance in level. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4104594625" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Slow, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse, Fear and Immobilize effects as well as Toxic and Cold Damage with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1108383803" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Slow, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse, Fear and Immobilize effects and improves your resistance to Toxic and Cold Damage."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P456139789" "+Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Confuse, Fear, Slow, Cold, Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P69254025" "The Antidote has granted you temporary resistance to Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse and Fear and Immobilize effects and your resistance to Toxic and Cold Damage is improved."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Paralytic Poison 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2127894003" "Paralytic Poison"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P778647036" "Ranged Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P4045211070" "This Paralytic Poison viciously attacks a foe's nervous system and can leave an affected target completely Held and defenseless. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2901818041" "Your {Powername} Holds {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3786662314" "{PlayerSource} attempts to Hold you with a Paralytic Poison."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3285550051" "The Paralytic Poison has left you completely Held and defenseless!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Poison Trap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1358094474" "Poison Trap"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P673564903" "Place Trap: PBAoE Foe Hold, -END, -Recovery, Chance to Hold, Minor DoT(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1057178172" "You can build a Poison Trap on the ground. Any foes that pass near the Poison Trap will cause it to detonate and release its toxic vapors. The poison is a highly toxic nerve gas, and any foes in the affected area may be drained of much of their Endurance and quickly Held or begin choking while suffering a minor amount of Toxic damage over time.  The trap is almost impossible to detect, but it is fragile and may be set off by an enemy's explosion. Even if destroyed, the Trap will detonate. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Venomous Gas 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1986312287" "Venomous Gas"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1112704536" "Toggle: PBAoE, Foe -Res(All), -DMG(All), -Def(All), -To(Hit)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1183280710" "You surround yourself in a cloud of toxic vapors that significantly weaken any enemies that get near you.  Affected foes have their defense, damage resistance, damage and chance to hit reduced moderately.  Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1577325525" "Your {PowerName} weakens all nearby enemies!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3466742994" "-Res(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3288548701" "-Res(All), -DMG(All), -Def(All), -To Hit"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Radiation Emission 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3883900150" "Radiation Emission"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2059255153" "Radiation Emission powers allow you to manipulate atomic particles and waves to protect your allies and weaken your enemies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Radiation Emission 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3533172966" "Radiant Aura"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P336745852" "PBAoE, Ally +Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P972381749" "You can use Radiant Aura to heal some of your wounds, and the wounds of your group. This power has a small radius, so your allies need to be near you if they wish to be affected. Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Radiation Infection 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3091774412" "Radiation Infection"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1946311240" "Toggle: Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -DEF, -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P3488173255" "Infects a targeted foe with deadly radiation, severely reducing their chance to hit and Defense. All foes that come near the target will also become infected. The Radiation Infection will last until you deactivate it, or until the original target is defeated. Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2574572377" "Your {PowerName} weakens all nearby foes."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3177972463" "You have been weakened by a {PowerName} from {PlayerSource}, decreasing your chance to hit and defense!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2125517953" "-DEF, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4112896100" "The Radiation Infection has reduced your Defense and chance to hit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Accelerate Metabolism 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P275167913" "Accelerate Metabolism"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2302020220" "Close (AoE), Ally +SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, +DMG +Res(Effects)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1318712485" "Activating this power emits radiation that increases the running speed, attack speed, Endurance recovery, and damage potential of all nearby allies. Affected heroes' metabolisms are increased so much that they become resistant to effects such as Sleep, Hold, Disorient, Immobilization and Endurance Drain. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1550301107" "You begin to accelerate your metabolism, and the metabolism of all nearby allies."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3547230991" "{PlayerSource} boosts your damage, speed, recharge, recovery and resistance to status effects with {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2942153168" "+SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, +Dam, +Res(Effects)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2897583752" "Your metabolism has been boosted.  Your movement speed and attack rate are improved. Your damage and Endurance recovery are increased as well.  Lastly, you are resistant to Sleep, Mez, Disorient, Immobilization and Endurance Drain."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Enervating  Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1082274496" "Enervating Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2214322243" "Toggle: Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -DMG, -Res"
// Power Help Text :
"P3687495261" "While this power is active, you irradiate a targeted foe, and all foes nearby, with a deadly dose of radiation. This radiation weakens exposed targets, decreasing the damage of their attacks.  It also significantly weakens their resistance, so they will take much more damage from other attacks. Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2100668018" "Your {PowerName} reduced the damage potential of all nearby foes."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1913293537" "{PlayerSource} reduced your damage and resistance to damage with an {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3022714566" "-DMG, -Res"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3774123069" "Your Damage potential and Resistances have been reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3057588896" "Mutation"
// Power Help Text :
"P1826458748" "Using a concentrated burst of radiation, you can revive a fallen hero and Mutate them into a killing machine. The Mutated hero has increased damage, chance to hit, Endurance recovery, and attack speed and is protected from XP Debt for 90 seconds. The entire experience is very taxing on the Mutated hero, and they will soon be severely weakened. All effects of the Mutation will eventually wear off. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayConfirm :
"P285856014" "{PlayerSource} would like to Resurrect and Mutate you.  You will have full Health and Endurance and be extremely powerful for a while, but will weaken after 90 seconds. Do you Accept?"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1832549363" "Mutated"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3576880470" "Your have been mutated.  Your chance to hit and attack rate are improved. Your damage and Endurance recovery are increased as well.  You are also protected from XP Debt for 90 seconds. The experience is taxing however, and you will soon weaken when all of the effects of this mutation wear off."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P920298392" "You Mutate {PlayerDest} and heal them for {Damage} points of damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P927448213" "{PlayerSource} returns you from the brink of death and heals you for {Damage} points of damage. For a while, you are Mutated beyond belief and have increased strength, but this will burn out fast, and you will be weakened in about 90 seconds."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3161843313" "Your accelerated Mutation has worn off, and you are now weakened."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lingering radiation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3321233827" "Lingering Radiation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4020505167" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Speed, -Recharge, -Regen"
// Power Help Text :
"P1417733947" "You can emit Lingering Radiation that reduces the attack rate, movement speed, and Regeneration rate of the target, and all nearby foes. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2645330428" "{PlayerSource} slows your attack speed, movement rate and regeneration rate with their {PowerName}"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P319543156" "-SPD, -Recharge, -Regen"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3611700118" "Your Attack rate, Running speed, and Regeneration rate have been reduced by the Lingering Radiation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Choking Cloud 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2196045966" "Choking Cloud"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1228973208" "Toggle: PBAoE, Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2718652843" "While active, you generate toxic radioactive gas around yourself. Any nearby foes may be overcome by the gas, leaving them choking and helpless. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P835496752" "You are caught in a Choking Cloud."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fallout 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P310781374" "Fallout"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P783614258" "Post-Defeat: PBAoE, Extreme DMG(Energy), Foe -To Hit, -DEF, -DMG, -Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2435590890" "After an ally falls in battle, you can activate this power to extract the energy from their body to deal a massive amount of Energy damage to any nearby foes. All affected foes are extremely weakened by the Fallout, and their chance to hit, Defense, Damage and Damage Resistance is severely reduced.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2158078059" "You use the energy of {PlayerDest} to unleash a massive {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2416771117" "{PlayerSource} uses your energy to unleash a massive {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : EMP Pulse 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P987369644" "EM Pulse"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3111590990" "PBAoE, Foe Hold, -END, -Regen, Special vs. Robots; Self -Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P3436877588" "You can unleash a massive pulse of electromagnetic energy. This EMP can affect machines, and is even powerful enough to affect synaptic brain patterns.  It will drain the Endurance and HP Regeneration of all affected targets and leave them incapacitated and Held for a long while. Additionally, most machines and robots will take moderate high damage. However, this power uses a lot of Endurance and leaves you unable to recover Endurance for a while. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P799513638" "Hold, -Regen"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3632529316" "You are Held by the EMP Pulse and your Regeneration Rate is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3216666060" "Your {PowerName} reduces the regeneration rate of {PlayerDest}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1491019888" "{PlayerSource} reduces your regeneration rate with an {PowerName}"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2665432657" "Your {PowerName} has left you exhausted!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Sonic Debuff 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P565143336" "Sonic Resonance"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2998248482" "You have the ability to control sound in several fashions.  You can create semi-solid barriers, set up waves which weaken or strengthen a target, as well as creating soothing sounds which act to counteract any negative effects which may exist on your friends."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Siphon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P646438851" "Sonic Siphon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3255195607" "Ranged, Foe -Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1007995414" "By setting up a constant vibration within the body of your foe, you weaken their Damage Resistance. Affected targets will take more damage from successful attacks.   Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3647738614" "Your {PowerName} has reduced {PlayerDest}'s resistances."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P182951110" "Your resistance to damage has been reduced by the {PowerName} of {PlayerSource}."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P290923559" "Your Resistances have been weakened by the Sonic attack."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Barrier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3785736125" "Sonic Barrier"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2639635747" "Ranged, Ally +Res(Smash, Lethal, Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2545197852" "This shield dramatically reduces the damage an ally takes from Smashing, Lethal, and Toxic attacks for a limited time. You cannot stack multiple Sonic Barriers on the same target; however, the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Sonic Haven. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2959881722" "You protect {PlayerDest} from physical attacks with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3976820757" "{PlayerSource} protects you from physical attacks with a {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3556417710" "+Res(Smash, Lethal, Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1911675282" "The Sonic Shield has increased your resistances to Smashing, Lethal and Toxic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Haven 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1160094573" "Sonic Haven"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3358878122" "Ranged, Ally +Res(Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2453669508" "This shield dramatically reduces the damage an ally takes from Fire, Cold, Energy, and Negative Energy attacks for a limited time. You cannot stack multiple Sonic Havens on the same target; however, the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Sonic Barrier. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P321411657" "+Res(Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative Energy)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P247047123" "The Sonic Shield has increased your resistances to Fire, Cold, Energy and Negative Energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Cage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1900924020" "Sonic Cage"
// Power Help Text :
"P498296898" "Encases the target in an impenetrable field of sonic waves. The target cannot attack or be attacked. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3173278283" "You have been encased in a Sonic Cage.  You cannot be harmed, but you can only use powers which affect you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disruption Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2857326375" "Disruption Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2877695354" "Toggle: Ranged (Target Ally AoE), Foe -Res"
// Power Help Text :
"P2163685874" "You set up a constant wave of sonic energy around an ally, weakening the Damage Resistance of all nearby foes. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1058328827" "The Ally Buff Field creates an area around a target ally which reduces the Resistance of all foes near them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Dispersion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P134395228" "Sonic Dispersion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2105574571" "Toggle: PBAoE, Ally +Res(All DMG except Psionic, Hold, Immobilize, Disorient)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3945274325" "You create a large field of sonic waves, protecting all allies inside. The Sonic Dispersion gives all allies within increased Resistance against all damage except Psionic. The Sonic Bubble also protects allies from Immobilization, Disorient, and Hold effects. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3939492490" "You protect {PlayerDest} from most damage types with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2535806516" "{PlayerSource} protects you from most damage types with a {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2481919485" "+Res(All Damage but Psionic, Hold, Immobilize, Disorient)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1969680326" "The Sonic Bubble is granting you Resistance to all types of damage as well as Hold, Immobilize and Disorienting effects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic  Repulsion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P448289933" "Sonic  Repulsion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2989681105" "Toggle: Ranged (Target Ally AoE), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1783834580" "You create a powerful sonic resonance around an ally, repelling all foes nearby. You will lose endurance for each target repelled.  Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P146549774" "You protect {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}, and will knock down any villain that approach them."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2574818106" "{PlayerSource} protects you with a {PowerName}, knocking back any foes that get too close."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P310186307" "A sonic field has been placed around you, which repels all foes who attempt to get near you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Clarity 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3612462228" "Clarity"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2123823464" "Ally +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Terrorize, Confusion), +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P3551660960" "By bouncing a carefully pitched sound wave off an ally's ear drum, you can free them from any Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confusion, Fear, or Immobilize effects, and leave them resistant to such effects for a good while. Protection will improve with multiple applications and as you advance in level. Clarity also provides your ally enhanced perception. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3167097237" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confusion, Fear, and Immobilize effects with your {PowerName} power, and improve their Perception."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3784635774" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confusion, Fear, and Immobilize effects and improve your Perception."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P614519586" "+Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Fear, Confuse, Immobilize), +Perception"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1217409435" "The soothing waves of sound clear your mind of all Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confusion, Fear, and Immobilize effects and improve your Perception."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Liquefy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4245490498" "Liquefy"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2188979389" "Ranged (Location AoE), Minor DMG(Smashing/Energy), Foe Hold, Knockdown, -To Hit, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P1228883369" "You unleash a barrage of sonic waves on the Earth itself, generating a powerful, localized earthquake. The impact of the sonic shockwave may Hold some foes and deal some minor damage. Most foes that pass through the location will fall down. The violent shaking also reduces their chance to hit and Defense. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4153304885" "Hold, -To Hit, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1314129090" "The ground beneath you has been liquefied!  You are stuck in sludge and taking minor damage.  Your chance to hit, Defense and movement rates are reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P258400189" "You {PowerName} the ground!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Storm Summoning 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3494545450" "Storm Summoning"
// DisplayHelp :
"P834699347" "You can command the forces of nature! Storm Summoning allows you to control wind and weather to aid your allies and wreak havoc on your foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Gale 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2583867379" "Gale"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2888124115" "Ranged (Cone), Minor DMG(Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P3697559231" "You can call forth a tremendous gust of Gale force winds that knock down foes and deal some Smashing damage in a wide cone area. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : O2 Boost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4232593684" "O2 Boost"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1565891011" "Ally Heal, +Res(Disorient, Sleep, End Drain), +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P3114444064" "Saturates the air around a targeted ally with rich oxygen, healing their wounds. The O2 Boost can protect a targeted ally from Sleep, Stun and Endurance Drain effects as well as increase perception. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1630761439" "Res(Disorient, Sleep, End Drain)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1243226818" "The O2 Boost has improved your resistance to Sleep, Stun and Endurance Drain effects."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2736283525" "{PlayerDest} is healed for {Damage} points of damage and is protected from Sleep and Disorientation."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3172217792" "{PlayerSource} heals you for {Damage} points of damage and protect you from Sleep and Disorientation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Snow Storm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P94096402" "You Slow the attack and movement speed of all nearby foes with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P4081415245" "{PlayerSource} slows you with a {PowerName}"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Steamy Mist 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P88341138" "Steamy Mist"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P647071371" "Toggle: PBAoE, Team Stealth, +DEF(All), +Res(Fire, Cold, Energy, Confuse)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2439766910" "Your mastery of the elements allows you to hide yourself and all nearby allies within a Steamy Mist. Steamy Mist makes you and your allies harder to see and increases your Defense bonus to all attacks, while reducing Fire, Cold, and Energy damage, as well as your Foes ability to Confuse you. You cannot use any other Concealment type powers while using Steamy Mist.  Recharge: Slow"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1096343037" "{PlayerSource} hides you within their {PowerName}"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4117047074" "Stealth, +DEF(All), +Res(Fire, Cold, Energy, Confuse)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1369785806" "The Steamy Mist is making you more difficult to detect.  This increases your Defense and gives you some resistance to Fire, Cold, Energy and Confuse."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1603587547" "Freezing Rain"
// Power Help Text :
"P1442985771" "Summons Freezing Rain at a targeted location. Freezing Rain deals minimal Cold damage to anything that passes through the storm. It also Slows the affected foes and severely reduces their Defense and resistance to damage. Many foes may even slip and fall trying to escape the storm. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3768531935" "The Freezing Rain is causing cold damage to you and has reduced your damage potential, resistance, attack rate and running speed."
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hurricane 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1760327861" "Hurricane"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1862200715" "Toggle: PBAoE, Foe -Range, -To Hit, Repel, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P3414490863" "You can summon a Hurricane. The wind and rain from this massive storm reduce the range and chance to hit of nearby foes. The massive winds of this storm continuously force foes away from you. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P550045858" "You reduce the range and chance to hit of all nearby foes with your {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3138537290" "-Range, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3051269457" "Hurricane Force winds are reducing the visual range and chance to hit of all enemies around the Storm Summoner!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2587177338" "Your {PowerName} partially hit!  {PlayerDest} is not repelled by the Hurricane!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3821930393" "{Playersource} partially hits you with their Hurricane! You evaded the Repel!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Thunder Clap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3304416267" "Thunder Clap"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P824375189" "PBAoE, Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P159762564" "You can call forth a tremendous Thunder Clap that will Disorient most foes in a large area around you. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2901563750" "The Thunder Clap has left you Disoriented."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Tornado 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2117529527" "Tornado"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3544628265" "Summon Tornado: PBAoE Minor DMG(Smash), Foe Knockback, Fear, Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P254400622" "Conjures up a funnel cloud at a targeted location. The Tornado will chase down your foes, tossing them into the air and hurling them great distances. The victims are left Disoriented and with reduced Defense. The Tornado is a menacing sight, and can even cause panic among your foes. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2919214753" "You have been Disoriented by the Tornado."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lightning Storm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P741247010" "Lightning Storm"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3390340215" "Create Storm: Ranged, High DMG(Energy), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P1054232470" "You can create a massive Lightning Storm that will strike any foe that approaches you. Lightning from this storm can knock down and damage all nearby foes, and can even instill panic. Lightning bolts will continue to fall as long as the storm remains. Recharge: Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Thermal Radiation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1881175236" "Thermal Radiation"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2307345259" "You have the ability to control heat and Thermal Radiation.  This allows you to protect allies from harm, heal them or increase their abilities.  You can also weaken your enemies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Warmth 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2367202029" "Warmth"
// Power Help Text :
"P2993381279" "You can use your Warmth to heal some of your wounds, and the wounds of your group. This power has a small radius, so your allies need to be near you if they wish to be affected. Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fire Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P576070762" "Thermal Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1684799313" "Ranged, Ally +Res(Fire, Lethal, Smash, Cold)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2409765686" "Casts a Thermal Shield on one of your allies and grants them damage resistance to Lethal, Smashing and Fire damage. Thermal Shield also provides minimal resistance to Cold damage. You cannot stack multiple Thermal Shields on the same target, however the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Plasma Shield. You cannot use this power on yourself.  Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2577444705" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Smashing, Lethal, Fire and Cold Damage with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2842680320" "You are now more resistant to Smashing, Lethal, Fire, and Cold damage, due to the {PowerName} from {PlayerSource}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Cauterize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P207511356" "Cauterize"
// Power Help Text :
"P3874865543" "Heals a single targeted ally by cauterizing their wounds. You cannot use this power to heal yourself. Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Plasma Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1907338798" "Plasma Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3994307906" "Ranged, Ally +Res(Energy, Negative, Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P530377386" "Envelope an ally in pure plasma. The Plasma Shield gives your ally resistance to Energy, Negative Energy, and Fire damage. You cannot stack multiple Plasma Shields on the same target, however the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Fire Shield. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P507595321" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Energy, Negative Energy and Fire Damage with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1541038042" "You are now more resistant to Energy, Negative Energy, and Fire damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power of the Phoenix 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4203838221" "Power of the Phoenix"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3997289450" "Ally Rez, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P280766623" "Revives a fallen ally. The fiery resurrection blasts nearby foes with an explosion and knocks them down and Disorients them. Your ally will revive with most of their Hit Points and Endurance.  They will also be invulnerable for a brief time, as well as protected from XPDebt for 90 seconds.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3686639660" "You rise {PlayerDest} from the ashes with the power of the Phoenix."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1384260762" "You rise from the ashes with the Power of the Phoenix."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2862738113" "Invulnerable, +XP Debt Protection"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1011213513" "You have risen from the ashes. You are untouchable for 15 seconds and are protected from XP Debt for 90 seconds."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P297828065" "Your {PowerName} brings {PlayerDest} back from the brink of defeat!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2874174058" "The {PowerName} of {PlayerSource} brings you back from the brink of defeat!"
// DisplayFloat :
"P2901365799" "Untouchable"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Thaw 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2439537416" "Thaw"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1756824576" "Ally +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Confuse, Fear, Cold, Slow)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1511937959" "Warms an ally and frees them from any Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse, Fear, Slow and Immobilize effects and leaves them resistant to such effects for a good while. Thaw also grants the target some resistance to Cold damage. Some of the effects of this power will improve with multiple applications and as you advance in level. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2658451446" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Cold, Slow, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse, Fear, and Immobilize effects with your {PowerName} power."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1190732604" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Cold, Slow, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse, Fear, and Immobilize effects."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1019438714" "+Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Confuse, Fear, Cold, Slow)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3238831788" "You have been Thawed. You now have temporary resistance to Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Confuse, Fear and slow effects and your resistance to Cold is improved."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Forge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P851798312" "Forge"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P283127640" "Ally +DMG, +To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P2102597321" "Forge a single ally target into a killing machine.  Forge immensely enhances a single ally's Damage and chance to hit. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1211375038" "You greatly increase the Damage and chance to hit of {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1510870276" "{PlayerSource} greatly increases your Damage and chance to hit."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3901010973" "+DMG, +To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1551320456" "You have been Forged into a killing machine.  Your Damage and chance to hit have all been increased."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Heat Exhaustion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3152332950" "Heat Exhaustion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2999723572" "Ranged Foe -DMG, -END, -Recovery, -Regeneration"
// Power Help Text :
"P810458816" "Overwhelm a single foe with waves of exhausting heat. The initial effect will drain the target of some Endurance, but the heat is so overwhelming that the affected target will be weakened.  Their Damage output, Endurance Recovery and Hit Point Regeneration will all be reduced. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3261174165" "Your {PowerName} reduced the Damage output, Endurance Recovery and HP Regeneration of {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P681276275" "{PlayerSource} reduces your Damage output, Endurance Recovery and HP Regeneration."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1827267252" "-DMG, -Recovery, -Regeneration"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1225787959" "Your Damage output, Endurance Recovery and HP Regeneration have been reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Melt Armor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3190899346" "Melt Armor"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P883673132" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Res, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P3795509611" "The searing heat from this power is enough to melt the armor and defenses of all targets in the affected area. Melt Armor significantly weakens the Defense and Damage Resistance of the affected targets. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1591168787" "Your {PowerName} reduced the Defense and Damage Resistance of {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P503219343" "{PlayerSource} reduces your Defense and Damage Resistance."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1874250117" "-DMG, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P397266516" "Your Defense and Damage Resistances have been reduced."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Time Manipulation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P869452725" "Time Manipulation"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3959878513" "By gazing into the flow of time you are able to manipulate time itself.  Time Manipulation allows you to inflict crippling debuffs, buff and heal allies and also be able to empower effects on single targets through careful use of Time Crawl and Temporal Selection."
// SetAccountTooltip :
"P523734060" "You need to either be a VIP player or have purchased the Time Manipulation power set to have access to this feature."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Time Crawl 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2238940030" "Time Crawl"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1722587764" "Ranged Foe, -Speed, -Recharge, -Regen, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3536371248" "You're able to dramatically slow the time around a single enemy, reducing their movement speed and attack rate.  Time is slowed to such an extreme that their wounds will take longer to heal, reducing their regeneration rate.  Time Crawl applies the Delayed effect on its target.  Debuff and control effects from other Time Manipulation powers are increased on targets affected by Delayed.  Recharge: Long."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P80878853" "-Speed, -Recharge, -Regen, Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3482489949" "Your attack rate, movement speed and regeneration rate have been reduced"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4250415469" "You reduce the attack rate, movement speed, regeneration rate of the target."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2451870868" "{PlayerSource} slows you down to a crawl with their {PowerName}, reducing your movement speed, attack speed and regeneration speed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Temporal Mending 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P20492702" "Temporal Mending"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2562578656" "PBAoE, Ally +Heal, Heal Over Time, +Res(Slow, Regen Debuff)"
// Power Help Text :
"P637007078" "You mend the wounds of yourself and nearby allies by placing your bodies in a past or future state where they are far less injured.  Temporal Mending will immediately heal its targets and continue to heal them for an equal amount over the next 6 seconds.  Additionally, affected allies will gain some resistance to slow effects and regeneration debuffs.  Allies affected by the Accelerated effect will receive additional healing from this power.  Temporal Mending will apply a regeneration bonus instead of heal over time for a short while if the user is in a PvP zone.  Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1964158182" "Your {PowerName} heals you for {Damage} health."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2599404221" "{PlayerSource} heals you for {Damage} health with their {PowerName}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1831842746" "Your {PowerName} continues to heal you for {Damage} health."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4029204276" "{PlayerSource} continually heals you for {Damage} health with their {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Times Juncture 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1147937862" "Time's Juncture"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2191782139" "Toggle: PBAoE Foe (-Damage, -Speed, -To Hit)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4222109235" "You create a time dilation field around you causing enemies who get too close to be slowed to a crawl, their movement speed, damage and chance to hit will be decreased substantially.  Enemies affected by Delayed have these affects increased.  Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3595822575" "You reduce the damage, movement speed and chance to hit of all nearby foes with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2549879092" "{PlayerSource} reduces your damage, speed and chance to hit with their {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1722386105" "-Damage, -Speed, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P384004502" "The flow of time has been dramatically slowed around the foe using Time's Juncture reducing your damage, speed and chance to hit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Temporal Selection 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P492426561" "Temporal Selection"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3301978780" "Ally +Damage, +Recharge, +Regeneration"
// Power Help Text :
"P3815890288" "You distort time around an ally, selecting a period of time where their abilities are at their highest.  Their damage, attack rate and regeneration rates are dramatically increased for a brief period.  This power places the Accelerated effect on the target.  While this is in effect, the target has any healing and healing over time effects from Temporal Mending or Chrono Shift significantly increased.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P170218134" "You significantly increase {PlayerDest}'s damage, recharge rate and regeneration for a short time."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1338077671" "{PlayerSource} greatly increases your Damage, Recharge Rate and Regeneration."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P760049584" "+Damage, +Recharge, +Regeneration"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2257768674" "Your movements have been sped up as if you're flowing more quickly through time.  You gain a significant bonus to your damage, recharge rate and regeneration."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Distortion Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3035182246" "Distortion Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2771735844" "Ranged (Location AoE), Foe(-Recharge, -Speed), Chance for Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P555632213" "You can choose an area to slow the flow of time down to a crawl.  Enemies who enter the field will have their attack rate and speed slowed dramatically.  In addition, affected enemies might become held as they are frozen in time.  Targets affected by Time Crawl will have the chance to be held increased.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3340992146" "Your {PowerName} reduces your targets' Movement and Recharge Speed."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3095982155" "-Speed, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2656174618" "The Distortion Field has reduced your Recharge and Movement Speed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Time Stop 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1303004440" "Time Stop"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4217442808" "Ranged Hold, Foe -Regen, -Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P3620751643" "You trap your target within the flow of time causing them to be held helpless.  Even those resistant to the effects of Time Stop's hold will still have their regeneration rate and healing effects reduced for a brief period.  Targets affected by Time Crawl will suffer from a more powerful hold, however its benefits are brief.  Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2288338409" "Hold, -Heal, -Regen"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3345956946" "You have been held by Time Stop.  Your healing effects and regeneration rate have also been reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3996881439" "You hold {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} and reduce their healing and regeneration rate!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P258318004" "{PlayerSource} holds you with their {PowerName} and reduces your regeneration rate and healing!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1338756627" "Your Time Crawl effect empowers {PowerName}'s hold effect on {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3804716665" "Being Delayed has caused {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} to be more effective."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Farsight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2926793761" "Farsight"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3803720508" "PBAoE Team, +To-Hit, +Defense(All), +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P2293728109" "You give your allies a brief glimpse of the future and what is to come.  This provides you and your team a moderate increase to your chance to hit and defense for a short period of time.   Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3619822295" "You grant your allies the ability to briefly glimpse into the future thus increasing their Defense, Perception and Chance to Hit."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1389102462" "{PlayerSource} boosts your Defense, Perception and Chance to Hit with {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4278084149" "+To-Hit, +Defense(All), +Perception"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2593400803" "You have brief glimpses of the future allowing you to predict your foes' movements.  Your Defense, Perception and Chance to Hit is increased briefly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Slowed Response 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1310678703" "Slowed Response"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3824425035" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Defense, -Resistance"
// Power Help Text :
"P4177343132" "You manipulate time around a targeted foe causing their reflexes to become slowed and sluggish.  This causes them to have decreased defense and damage resistance.  A target affected by Time Crawl will suffer from a more powerful effect.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1600483695" "Your {PowerName} reduces the defenses and resistances of your target and nearby foes."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2407039961" "{PlayerSource} reduces your defense and resistances with their {PowerName}"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3877240234" "-Defense(All), -Resistance(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2935672040" "Your defense and resistance has been lowered by Slowed Response."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chrono Shift 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3129124653" "Chrono Shift"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1350508662" "PBAoE, Team +Recharge, Heal, +End, Moderate Healing over Time, +Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P2578936003" "You cause nearby allies to act more quickly by allowing them to slip through the time stream seamlessly.  When Chrono Shift is activated, you and nearby allies will immediately recover a portion of your health and endurance.  Chrono Shift will greatly increase the Recharge Speed of nearby allies for the duration of the power, additionally for a short while the flow of time will constantly undo a portion of your allies' wounds causing them to periodically recover health and recover endurance.  An ally affected by Temporal Selection will recover additional health from Chrono Shift.  Chrono Shift will apply a regeneration bonus instead of heal over time for a short while if the user is in a PvP zone.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P689989828" "Your {PowerName} heal you for {Damage} health."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P147486625" "Your {PowerName} restores {Damage} endurance."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P168839769" "{PlayerSource} restores {Damage} endurance with their {PowerName}."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Trick Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2922508614" "Trick Arrow"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4162466956" "Trick Arrows are tipped with an odd variety of payloads, which if used strategically, can dramatically alter a battle site."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Entangling Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3890749173" "Entangling Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2638259388" "Ranged, Target Immobilize, -Fly, Slow"
// Power Help Text :
"P4026626189" "Upon impact, the Entangling Arrow releases a strong net that can Immobilize most targets. This non-lethal device deals no damage and does not prevent targets from attacking. The Entangling Arrow can bring down flying entities, halts jumping and slows all of your actions. Entangling Arrow has a fairly low Endurance cost and a bonus to its Accuracy. Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2964557942" "Immobilize, -Fly, Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3914642772" "You have been caught in a net.  You cannot move or fly and your actions are slowed."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Flash Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2538058937" "Flash Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2306152642" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Visibility, -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P912604196" "This arrow explodes in a dazzling flash of light and sound. The targets are so blinded that they can hardly see a thing. Most villains will not be able to see past normal melee range, although some may have better perception. If the villains are attacked, they will be alerted to your presence, but will suffer a penalty to chance to hit. Recharge: Slow"
