"P2067335990" "You can send a bolt of electricity through multiple opponents, causing a muscle spasm and dealing minor damage.  Each foe is knocked down, and the electric charge can fork several times, jumping to several opponents rapidly.  Damage: Minor, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2213400709" "Knockdown, -End"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stunning Aura 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2659011467" "Conductive Aura"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3425504256" "Toggle: PBAoE, Foe -End, Self +Rec, +Regen"
// Power Help Text :
"P702028802" "While this power is active, the air around you becomes charged with electricity, leaping out and shocking foes that get too close.  Foes will lose some endurance, while you gain Recovery and Regeneration per target hit. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3035366588" "-End"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1175493268" "You have been hit by the Conductive Aura!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Static Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3286362090" "Static Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P27120137" "Target (Location AoE), Foe Sleep, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P3271222473" "You can build up a Static Field at a nearby location. Any foes in the field may lose control of their muscles due to the static charge, and will shake violently.  Foes may also be drained of some endurance, and some of that endurance may be transferred to nearby allies. Any attack will interrupt the effect temporarily and foes will re-gain control, although their movement and attack rates will be reduced.  This effect can last for some time, and will continue to paralyze foes in the field.  Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P126903745" "Sleep, -End"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P625742039" "You are temporarily paralyzed by the static field."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Paralyzing Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2075115033" "Paralyzing Blast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3179859045" "Ranged AoE, Foe Hold, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P2017388294" "Summoning a large amount of energy, you can completely paralyze a group of foes in cages of electricity for a short time.  These foes may be drained of some endurance as well.  Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1220245880" "You have been caged by the Paralyzing Blast."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Synaptic Overload 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3263998155" "Synaptic Overload"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P711874253" "Ranged Chain AoE, Foe Confuse, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P1798939764" "This power can subtly scramble the synapses of any target affected, causing hallucinations and confusion amongst foes.  The electric charge lasts for some time, and will jump slowly to other opponents causing wide spread confusion.  Foes may not be aware that this has happened, and will not be alerted to your presence.  You will also not receive experience for any damage dealt by confused opponents. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4006396885" "Confuse, -End"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2909616078" "Your neurons have been scrambled by the Synaptic Overload."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2362030961" "You scramble the senses of {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}, confusing them!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1196504450" "{PlayerSource} scrambles your senses with their {PowerName}, confusing you!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P639843269" "You confuse {PlayerDest} even more!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3406839748" "{PlayerSource} confuses you even more!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2848211071" "You confuse {PlayerDest}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1011784172" "{PlayerSource} confuses you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Gremlins 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P9578033" "Gremlins"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1317979993" "Summon Gremlins: Melee Minor DMG(Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2133657360" "Mastery over electricity allows you to create almost sentient elementals of lightning.  These elementals are mischievous in nature, and enjoy creating havoc and interfering with electronic equipment or magical cantrips.  They also never work alone, where there is one Gremlin, there is often another nearby. Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3273083397" "You call forth Two {PowerName} to wreak havoc!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Fire Control 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P757482867" "Fire Control"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3610410689" "You can control the essence of fire to entrap, scorch, and manipulate your foes with smoke and flame."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ring of Fire 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3459032824" "Immobilizes your target in a Ring of Fire, dealing Fire damage over time. More resilient foes may require multiple Fire Rings to Immobilize. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1688818094" "Immobilize, DoT(Fire)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P147771599" "The Ring of Fire is burning you and preventing you from moving."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Soot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P751630497" "Char"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P878115326" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Fire), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P3336901322" "Incapacitates a distant foe by Charring them with smoldering soot and cinders. The target is left helpless, choking on the soot. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2473398909" "The Soot is causing damage to you and preventing you from acting."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P592893931" "You burn {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Fire damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P906524009" "{PlayerSource} burns you for {Damage} points of Fire damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fire Cages 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2960001225" "Fire Cages"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1407073287" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DoT(Fire), Foe Immobilize"
// Power Help Text :
"P3718752007" "Immobilizes a group of foes in Fire Cages, dealing Fire damage over time. More resilient foes may require multiple Fire Cages to Immobilize. Fire Cages is slower and less damaging than Ring of Fire, but can capture multiple targets. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3011391955" "The Fire Cage is burning you and preventing you from moving."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Smoke 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2290599550" "Smoke"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2382461739" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Perception, -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P3897557222" "Covers all foes near your target in clouds of Smoke. The villains are so blinded that they can hardly see a thing. Most villains will not be able to see past normal melee range, although some may have better perception. If the villains are attacked, they will be alerted to your presence, but will suffer a penalty to their chance to hit. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3610348091" "You fill the area with {PowerName}, lowering the chance to hit and perception of {PlayerDest}!"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P4109791369" "You have been blinded by the Smoke from {PlayerSource}. Your chance to hit and perception have been reduced."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P560515883" "The Smoke is reducing your visual range and chance to hit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hot Feet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2705814161" "The ground is extremely hot and burning you.  Your running speed is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3065937262" "You activate {PowerName} and burn {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of fire damage, and Slow their attack speed and movement."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Flashfire 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3161065910" "Flashfire"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2551539250" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DMG(Fire), Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P1598889486" "You can bring forth a Flashfire to Disorient a group of foes and deal some damage over time. Target must be on the ground to activate Flashfire. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1517957279" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of fire damage to {PlayerDest}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
