// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2498472801" "Gravity Distortion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1351615561" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Smash), Foe Hold, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P2209473956" "Causes a single foe to be trapped in a misshapen gravity field, rendering them unable to take action. Gravity Distortion deals Smashing damage to the target. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2873383034" "DoT(Smash), Hold, -Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1640622380" "You have been caught in a Gravity Distortion.  You cannot move and cannot fly."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2951328981" "You crush {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2899920056" "{PlayerSource} crushes you for {Damage} points of Smashing damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Propel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1432627055" "Propel"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P796483470" "Ranged, High DMG(Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P2607992439" "You can open a gravitational rift and retrieve a heavy object, then Propel it at your foes for Smashing Damage. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2053203920" "You levitate something handy and Propel it at {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3272833962" "{PlayerSource} Propels something handy at you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Crushing Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P265849818" "Crushing Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1348701880" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DoT(Smash), Foe Immobilize, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P1432813375" "Creates a large gravitational field strong enough to Immobilize multiple foes. Crushing Field can also bring down flying entities. Slower and less damaging than Crush, but can capture multiple targets. Crushing Field deals Smashing damage over time and can Slow the movement of targets that escape its grasp. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dimension Shift 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3572177719" "Dimension Shift"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3677015509" "Your mastery of gravity allows you to manipulate dimensions, bringing multiple foes out of sync with reality. Your foes becomes completely intangible, and cannot affect or be affected by those in normal space. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2953255080" "You have been shifted into an alternate dimension.  You powers cannot effect anyone but yourself, but you cannot be harmed."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2145192229" "You shift {PlayerDest} into another dimension.  They are now intangible."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4172529713" "{PlayerSource} shift you into another dimension.  You are now intangible, and cannot affect or be affected by those in normal space."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Gravity Distortion Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3577978297" "Gravity Distortion Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3095732666" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P919459034" "Creates a large, intensely misshapen Gravity Distortion Field that encompasses several foes, rendering them unable to take any action. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P169853037" "You are being held in a Gravity Distortion Field."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Wormhole 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P704570369" "Wormhole"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4052788000" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Teleport, Disorient, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1354164583" "You can open a gravitational Wormhole behind a targeted foe and violently push them, and all nearby foes, through it. The victims are sent flying out the other end of the Wormhole and are left Disoriented. You determine the location of the Wormhole's end, and can place it high in the air if desired. More powerful foes may be resistant to the Wormhole effects. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fold Space 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1747473765" "Singularity"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1654473077" "Summon Singularity: Ranged Control Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1515802179" "You can create a very powerful Gravitational Singularity.  The Singularity will engage your foes, assaulting them with various gravity powers.  Any foes that attempt to approach the Singularity will be violently hurled away.  The Singularity cannot be healed, but is highly resistant to all forms of damage and nearly impervious to Controlling type powers. Type ''/release_pets'' in the chat window to release all your pets. Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P857968679" "You fold space into a singularity of massive power!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Ice Control 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2899985889" "Ice Control"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4141548241" "You can draw moisture from the air to create Icy formations. With these abilities, you can control ice with remarkable precision to dominate your foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chilblain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
