// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1606578898" "Secondary Mutation"
// Power Help Text :
"P995935683" "You acquire a secondary mutation.  This grants a random permanent buff for up to 20 minutes. No more than one Secondary Mutation can be in place at a time."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1576468784" "You begin to mutate!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : prestige_reveal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2583458172" "Reveal"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2552355914" "Clear Fog of War"
// Power Help Text :
"P820940147" "Your extensive knowledge of your surroundings will allow you to clear the "Fog of War" from any map once every 5 minutes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Prestige_Ninja_Run 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3724650206" "Ninja Run"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3055260744" "Toggle: Self +Run Speed, +Jump"
// Power Help Text :
"P4194699500" "A combination of quickness and acrobatic grace, Ninja Run allows you to move at high speed, whether on the ground or leaping from rooftop to rooftop.  This power is not as fast as Super Speed, nor will it allow you to jump as well as Super Leap, however it is considerably better than the Fitness powers Swift and Hurdle."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Prestige_Beast_Run 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P353074125" "Beast Run"
// Power Help Text :
"P3409336109" "Show off your bestial nature by using this power.  This power is not as fast as Super Speed, nor will it allow you to jump as well as Super Leap, however it is considerably better than the Fitness powers Swift and Hurdle."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Prestige_Steam_Jump 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4198656990" "Steam Jump"
// Power Help Text :
"P3775797962" "Your steam powered jump pack grants you the ability to not only jump great distances, but also jump and gain altitude in mid air! The steam powered jump pack will automatically shut down after 30 seconds of continuous use."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Alt_Hover_Board 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1416260743" "Rocket Board"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2660824618" "Toggle: Fly, +Flight Protection"
// Power Help Text :
"P1074202038" "You mount a Rocket Board allowing you to fly at great speeds.  However, while this power is active you will be unable to activate most powers.  Additionally this power will deactivate most powers upon activation.  This power also grants the user a measure of flight protection making them less likely to be knocked out the sky by some enemy attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Alt_Magic_Carpet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3780160518" "Flying Carpet"
// Power Help Text :
"P557041388" "You hop aboard a flying carpet allowing you to fly around with tremendous speed.  However, while this power is active you will be unable to activate most powers.  Additionally this power will deactivate most powers upon activation.  This power also grants the user a measure of flight protection making them less likely to be knocked out the sky by some enemy attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Alt_Coyote_Travel_Power 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4212945194" "Coyote Travel Power"
// Power Help Text :
"P2106894951" "You transform into a coyote granting you increased movement speed and jump height.  However, while this power is active you will be unable to activate most powers.  Additionally this power will deactivate most powers upon activation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Alt_Frisbee_Granter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2170899180" "Flying Disc"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P680179550" "Ranged, Throw Flying Disc"
// Power Help Text :
"P3918576793" "Use this power to throw a Flying Disc to a friend!  This will grant them a use of the Flying Disc power. You have an infinite number of Flying Discs that can be thrown to friends, although friends can only have 1 copy of the Flying Disc power at a time."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P107679889" "You throw a Flying Disc to {PlayerDest}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2291113423" "{PlayerSource} throws a flying disc to you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Walk 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P765711723" "Walk"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3132154248" "Toggle: Walk"
// Power Help Text :
"P3192041314" "Activating this power enables you to walk at a relaxed pace.  You will not be able to activate most powers while walking."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3343173849" "You slow down and begin walking."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shadowy Presence 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2941551186" "Shadowy Presence"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1278860822" "Self: +Stealth"
// Power Help Text :
"P266924693" "Activating this power shifts you into a semi-real shadow-state.  So long as you are not attacked and remain motionless, you will have extremely good stealth rating and be nearly invisible.  This power has a long, interruptible cast time and always takes 10 minutes to recharge."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1457797442" "You activate {PowerName} and become difficult to detect."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Event_PPD_Hardsuit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3027354919" "PPD Hardsuit Costume"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3289133866" "Costume Change"
// Power Help Text :
"P439556088" "This costume will let you dress up in a Paragon Police Hard Suit at any time. Note that the costume is mutually exclusive with most self-stealth powers, and cannot be used while shape shifted.  Thank you for joining us at PAX!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Event_Freakshow_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1928911875" "Freakshow Boss Costume"
// Power Help Text :
"P2069979598" "This costume will let you dress up as a Freakshow Boss at any time. Note that the costume is mutually exclusive with most self-stealth powers, and cannot be used while shape shifted.  Thank you for joining us at Comic-Con!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
