// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sprint 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Rest 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1562808046" "Rest"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1901614057" "Self Heal Recover, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P1243117624" "Activate Rest to heal Hit Points and recover Endurance. While Resting you cannot attack, and you are extremely vulnerable to attack and damage. Activation of Rest can be interrupted, and the power must be active for a few seconds before you start to recuperate."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2595713878" "You take a moment to rest and recover.  You are very vulnerable so be sure you are safe and far away from any enemies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fitness Fix 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2807415994" "Inherent Fitness Mod"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P514195764" "Auto: Self +Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P3889259966" "You recover Endurance slightly more quickly than normal. This ability is always on and does not cost any Endurance. You must be at least level 20 and have two other Fitness Powers before selecting Stamina."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Vision Phase 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P218371601" "Vision Phase"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Energy Flight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2366875938" "Energy Flight"
// Power Help Text :
"P2415030483" "Energy Flight allows you to travel large distances quickly.  If you attack a target while this power is on, your flight speed will be temporarily reduced.  Your Energy Flight speed increases with your Level."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Cosmic Balance 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1111172396" "Cosmic Balance"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3779229663" "Auto: Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1032747743" "Kheldians naturally thrive off the energy and essence of their teammates. Peacebringers' metamorphic nature allows them to bring balance to their team. Your Damage will increase for each nearby Tanker, Mastermind, Corruptor or Defender teammate. Your Damage Resistance will increase for each nearby Scrapper, Brute, Stalker or Blaster teammate. Each nearby Controller or Dominator teammate will grant you limited Protection from Control effects. Finally, each nearby Peacebringer, Warshade, or teamed Arachnos Soldier or Widow grants you some resistance to attack time slow effects. You cannot put Enhancements in this power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Combat Flight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3273733734" "Combat Flight"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3300408118" "Toggle: Self Fly, +DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P96772073" "For hovering and aerial combat. This power is much slower than Energy Flight, but provides some Defense, offers good air control, costs little Endurance, and has none of the penalties associated with Energy Flight. Switch to this mode when fighting other flying foes."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3690202278" "Your {PowerName} has made you harder to hit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shadow Step 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1065735556" "Shadow Step"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2537599147" "Ranged (Location), Self Teleport"
// Power Help Text :
"P2851402526" "You can Teleport long distances. Shadow Step has no recharge time, and can be reactivated without pause, as long as you have Endurance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Sustenance 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2642257944" "Dark Sustenance"
// Power Help Text :
"P2029291388" "Kheldians naturally thrive off the energy and essence of their teammates. Warshades' absorbing nature allows them to draw on the power of their teammates' power to increase their own. Your Damage Resistance will increase for each nearby Tanker, Mastermind, Corruptor or Defender teammate. Your Damage will increase for each nearby Scrapper, Stalker, Brute or Blaster teammate. Each nearby Controller or Dominator teammate will grant you limited Protection from Control effects. Finally, each nearby Peacebringer, Warshade, or teamed Arachnos Soldier or Widow grants you some resistance to attack time slow effects. You cannot put Enhancements in this power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shadow Recall 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3415254202" "Shadow Recall"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2036146223" "Zone-Range: Teleport Teammate"
// Power Help Text :
"P2702252942" "You can Teleport one of your teammates to yourself. The target must be a teammate or leaguemate and can be selected from the Team Window. You can also rescue a fallen teammate who may be in a hostile location, as long as he is on the same map. Range is not infinite, but extremely long and can be enhanced. This power can be interrupted."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Bright Nova Bolt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3954218628" "Bright Nova Bolt"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3139771016" "A very quick, but low damage bolt of Kheldian energy that can reduce a target's defense. This power is only available while in Bright Nova Form. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Very Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1777172959" "The Bright Nova Bolt has weakened your Defenses!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P252646315" "You hit {PlayerDest} with {Damage} points of energy damage from your {PowerName} and reduce his defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3940047881" "{PlayerSource} hits you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and reduces your defense!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1799681063" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of Smashing damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1719855107" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Smashing damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Bright Nova Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P980944765" "Bright Nova Blast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2683849460" "Ranged, High DMG(Energy), Foe -DEF, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P3885608740" "A much more powerful, yet slower version of Bright Nova Bolt. Bright Nova Blast sends a focused blast of Kheldian energy at a foe that can knock him back and reduce his defense. This power is only available while in Bright Nova Form. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3346324310" "The Bright Nova Blast has weakened your Defenses!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3791768667" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of energy damage to {PlayerDest} and reduce his defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2616416457" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and reduces your defense!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Bright Nova Scatter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1317349499" "Bright Nova Scatter"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4153926723" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Energy), Foe -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P1270600706" "Bright Nova Scatter sends bolts of Kheldian light energy to multiple targets at once within a cone area in front of the caster.  Bright Nova Scatter deals moderate energy damage to each affected target and reduces their defense. This power is only available while in Bright Nova Form. Damage: Moderate. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4180645475" "The Bright Nova Scatter has weakened your Defenses!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P646710516" "Your {PowerName} blasts {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage and reduce his defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Bright Nova Detonation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4249846001" "Bright Nova Detonation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2869038249" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Smash/Energy), Foe -DEF, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P3791098100" "You hurl a large blast of Kheldian light energy that violently explodes on impact, damaging all foes near the target, reducing their defense. Some affected targets may get knocked back. This power is only available while in Bright Nova Form. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4006882286" "The Bright Nova Detonation has weakened your Defenses!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P711956626" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your powerful {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and reduce his defense!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3349508954" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your powerful {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and reduce his defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1687926124" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : White Dwarf Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P845691889" "White Dwarf Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P178430653" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash/Energy), Foe -DEF, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P3557413578" "The White Dwarf Strike is a moderate melee attack that releases Kheldian light on impact, which can Knock Down foes, and reduce a target's Defense. This power is only available while in White Dwarf Form. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2790027432" "The White Dwarf Strike has weakened your Defenses!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2647643406" "You smash {PlayerDest} with your mighty {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and reduce his defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2858661874" "{PlayerSource} smashes you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and reduces your defense!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1130644308" "{PlayerSource} smashes you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : White Dwarf Smite 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2592831472" "White Dwarf Smite"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3928335530" "Melee, Heavy DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe -DEF, -Fly, Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P1999943949" "White Dwarf Smite is powerful melee attack that can often Disorient or Knock Down opponents. White Dwarf Smite can also bring down fliers, and reduce their defense. This power is only available while in White Dwarf Form. Damage: Heavy, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P824573525" "Disorient, -DEF, -Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1720669844" "You have been knocked down by the White Dwarf Smite.  You are Disoriented and cannot fly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : White Dwarf Flare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3531538009" "White Dwarf Flare"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2454419065" "PBAoE Melee, High DMG(Energy), Foe -DEF, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1218663445" "You channel the might of your Kheldian energy into the very Earth itself.  The ground erupts and cracks with luminous energy, blasting all nearby foes, knocking them back and reducing their defense. This power is only available while in White Dwarf Form. Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P820440408" "The White Dwarf Flare has weakened your Defenses!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3031868938" "You erupt the very Earth with your {PowerName}, dealing {Damage} points of energy Damage to {PlayerDest} and reducing his defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P984920834" "{PlayerSource} erupts the very Earth with his {PowerName}, dealing {Damage} points of energy Damage to you and reducing your defense."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4013144448" "You erupt the very Earth with your {PowerName}, dealing {Damage} points of energy Damage to {PlayerDest} and you reducing their defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : White Dwarf Sublimation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P10496376" "White Dwarf Sublimation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1324952732" "Self Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P1851031416" "Through perfect control of your body and energy, you can concentrate for a few moments and heal yourself. This power is only available while in White Dwarf Form. Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P454249131" "Your {PowerName} heals you for {Damage} hit points!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : White Dwarf Step 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2206278952" "White Dwarf Step"
// Power Help Text :
"P18208687" "White Dwarfs can Teleport long distances. White Dwarf Step has no recharge time, and can be reactivated without pause, as long as you have Endurance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : White Dwarf Antagonize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4108543668" "White Dwarf Antagonize"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P45218014" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Taunt"
// Power Help Text :
"P256507289" "This power attracts the attention of a foe and all those around him. Use this to pull villains off of an ally in trouble.  An Accuracy check is required to Taunt enemy players, but is not needed against critter targets.  Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1980192711" "Taunt"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2504115020" "The White Dwarf grabs your attention and you focus your attacks on it."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3213965175" "You Provoke {PlayerDest} to attack you."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3564954679" "Your {PowerName} partially hit!  {PlayerDest} is not taunted but their range is reduced!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2556803736" "{Playersource} partially hits you with their {PowerName}! Your range is reduced but the Taunt is not successful!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Nova Bolt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3505323644" "Dark Nova Bolt"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3090539366" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Negative), Foe -Recharge, -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P3330836454" "A very quick, but low damage attack that lowers your target's attack and movement speed. This power is only available while in Dark Nova Form. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Very Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2951545758" "Your Attack speed and movement speed have been reduced by the Dark Nova Bolt."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2452456133" "You hit {PlayerDest} with {Damage} points of negative energy damage from your {PowerName} and slow him."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1369688976" "{PlayerSource} hits you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and slows you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Nova Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2300912443" "Dark Nova Blast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3730608247" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe Knockback, -Recharge, -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P1463752316" "A much more powerful, yet slower version of Dark Nova Bolt. Dark Nova Blast sends focused negative Nictus energy at a foe.  This attack can knock down foes and will leave the targets' attack and movement speed slowed. This power is only available while in Dark Nova Form. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3911037012" "Your Attack speed and movement speed have been reduced by the Dark Nova Blast."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2185374914" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of negative energy damage to {PlayerDest} and slows him!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1868118289" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and slows you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Nova Emanation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P340077525" "Dark Nova Emanation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1286279837" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe -Recharge, -SPD, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P4246178003" "Sends bolts of Nictus dark energy to multiple targets at once within a cone area in front of the caster.  Deals moderate negative energy damage to each affected foe and reduces their attack rate and movement speed. This power is only available while in Dark Nova Form. Damage: Moderate. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1993623101" "Your Attack speed and movement speed have been reduced by the Dark Nova Emanation."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P43163476" "You hit {PlayerDest} with {Damage} points of negative energy damage from your {PowerName} and slow him!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Nova Detonation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2921354729" "Dark Nova Detonation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1441718266" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe Knockback, -Recharge, -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P501875815" "You hurl a blast of Dark Matter that violently explodes on impact, damaging all foes near the target. All affected targets' attack and movement speed are slowed.  Some foes may be knocked down. This power is only available while in Dark Nova Form. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1201481885" "Your Attack speed and movement speed have been reduced by the Dark Nova Detonation."

