"P2606045213" "Black Dwarf Smite"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P900531700" "Melee, Heavy DMG(Negative/Smash), Foe -Recharge, -SPD, -Fly, Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P3213977678" "Black Dwarf Smite is powerful melee attack that can often Disorient or Knock Down opponents. Black Dwarf Smite can also bring down fliers, and slows a targets attack and movement speed. This power is only available while in Black Dwarf Form. Damage: Heavy, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P619923407" "-SPD, -Recharge, -Fly, Disorient, Taunt"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P721319309" "You have been knocked out of the air and your Attack and movement speeds have been reduced by the Black Dwarf Smite.  You focus your attacks on the Black Dwarf."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Black Dwarf Drain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P658698346" "Black Dwarf Drain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3770236974" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe -Recharge, -SPD; Self +HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P1805307529" "You tap the primal forces of your Nictus power to create an Essence Draining conduit between a foe and yourself. This will transfer Hit Points from your enemy to yourself. Foes drained in this manner have their attack and movement speed reduced. This power is only available while in Black Dwarf Form. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3054577053" "Your Attack speed and movement speed have been reduced by the Black Dwarf Drain.  You focus your attacks on the Black Dwarf."
