// Display Name :
"P1257881243" "Black Dwarf Mire"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P838151008" "PBAoE, Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe -Recharge, -SPD; Self +DMG, +ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P1464272694" "Black Dwarf Mire can drain the essence of all nearby foes, thus increasing your own strength. Each affected foe will lose some Hit Points and add to your Damage and Accuracy. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2121509183" "Your {PowerName} steals {Damage} points of life from the essence of {PlayerDest} to increase your power!"
