"P851913854" "Inherent Fitness"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3253011688" "Fitness"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1178549424" "You become a pillar of fitness, and can receive a bonus to your basic physical attributes. These abilities are always on and do not cost any Endurance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
