"P2745605241" "Concealment"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3303860890" "These powers grant you Invisibility and Stealth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stealth 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3788574412" "You blend into your environment and can only be seen at very close range. Even if discovered, you are hard to see and have a bonus to Defense from all attacks. If, however, you attack while using this power, you will be discovered and will lose your Stealth and some of your Defense bonus. While Stealthy, your movement is Slowed. Stealth will not work with any other form of Concealment power such as Shadow Fall or Steamy Mist.  Very low Endurance cost."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
// DisplayPowerDefenseFloat :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Grant Invisibility 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3917858559" "Grant Invisibility"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3143585501" "Ranged, Teammate Stealth, +DEF(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2175666297" "Grants a targeted teammate or leaguemate Invisibility. The Invisibility lasts about 2 minutes. While your ally is Invisible, he probably will not be detected unless he attacks a target. If he attacks, he is still hard to see and maintains some bonus to Defense to all attacks.  This power works with other Concealment related powers."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P4108882767" "{PlayerSource} grants you Invisibility."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2623971958" "+DEF(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2302773260" "You have been turned Invisible. You are difficult to detect, and have a bonus to Defense to all attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Invisibility 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1723456838" "Invisibility"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4135515142" "Toggle: Self Stealth, +DEF(All except Psionic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2537755720" "You can bend light around yourself to become Invisible. While this power is active, you are almost impossible to detect. While Invisible, you cannot attack and can only use powers that affect yourself, however, you do have a Defense to all  except Psionic attacks.  This power will not work with other self affecting Concealment related powers such as Stealth or Shadow Fall.  Purchasing Invisibility requires the user to be level 14 and possess Stealth or Grant Invisibility."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3430542905" "You are now Invisible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Phase Shift 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3288641264" "Phase Shift"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3923775585" "Toggle: Self Intangible"
// Power Help Text :
"P910392417" "You can Phase Shift to become out of sync with normal space. Although you do not become completely Invisible, you are translucent and hard to see. You are intangible, and cannot affect or be affected by those in normal space. Although this power is a toggle, you cannot remain Phase Shifted for more than 30 seconds, even if you still have Endurance. Cannot be used with Rest. You must be at least level 14 and have two other Concealment Powers before selecting Phase Shift."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P922257729" "You Phase Shift out of normal space.  You are now intangible, are hard to see, and cannot affect or be affected by those in normal space."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Flight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3321619256" "Flight"
// DisplayHelp :
"P57685822" "Grants you various travel and flying combat abilities."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Combat Flight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P991533264" "Hover"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3013389671" "Toggle: Self Fly, +DEF(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2697835812" "For hovering and aerial combat. This power is much slower than Fly, but provides some Defense to all attacks, offers good air control, costs little Endurance, and has none of the penalties associated with Fly. Switch to this mode when fighting other flying foes."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
// DisplayPowerDefenseFloat :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Air Superiority 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
