"P1988217601" "Air Superiority"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1853402941" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash), Foe -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P2442465603" "This two-handed overhead melee attack can knock a flying target to the ground."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3885675710" "-Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2569929433" "You have been knocked to the ground!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1662970345" "Your {PowerName} drops {PlayerDest} from the skies."
