"P304060958" "Leadership"
// DisplayHelp :
"P569848964" "Good leaders are rare. These powers can grant bonuses to your and your teammates."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Defense 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3009043276" "Maneuvers"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1097757426" "Toggle: PBAoE, Team +DEF(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1448946145" "A good leader knows how to protect his team. While active, this power increases the Defense of yourself and all nearby teammates to all attacks."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1722481992" "Your {PowerName} increases your team's Defense."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P836189985" "{PlayerSource} increases your team's Defense with good {PowerName}."
