// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P55898000" "Assault"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P253176242" "Toggle: PBAoE, Team +DMG, Res(Taunt, Placate)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2916860670" "While this power is active, you and your nearby teammates deal more damage and are resistant to Taunt and Placate."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2420471347" "Your {PowerName} increases your team's damage potential and resistance to Taunt and Placate."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1338507259" "{PlayerSource} increases your team's damage potential and resistance to Taunt and Placate."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2588995686" "+DMG, Res(Taunt, Placate)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3093320529" "Your attack damage is improved due to good leadership and teamwork. You are partially resistant to Taunt and Placate."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Tactics 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1934302270" "Tactics"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3192701214" "Toggle: PBAoE, Team +To Hit, Res(Confuse, Fear), +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P4143165689" "While this power is active, your chance to hit and that of all your nearby teammates is increased. Your advanced Tactics also protect you and your team from Confuse and Fear effects, as well as your Perception so you can detect Stealthy foes.  Purchasing Tactics requires the user to be level 14 and possess Maneuvers or Assault."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P929745669" "Your {PowerName} increases your team's chance to hit and Perception."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1485429003" "{PlayerSource} increases your team's chance to hit and Perception with good {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3397519668" "+To Hit, Res(Confuse, Fear), +Perception"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1894767178" "Your chance to hit and Perception is improved due to good teamwork and Leadership."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Vengeance 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1379641621" "Vengeance"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1099678166" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Teammates +DMG, +To Hit, +DEF(All), Res(Effects)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2449138024" "The loss of a comrade enrages the team. When a teammate is defeated in combat, activate this power to grant you and your teammates a bonus to chance to hit, Damage and Defense to all attacks. A Vengeful team has no fear, and Vengeance protects you and your Teammates from Fear effects. It also gives you and your team great resistance to Sleep, Hold, Disorient, Immobilize, Confuse, Taunt, Placate and Knockback. You must be at least level 14 and have two other Leadership Powers before selecting Vengeance.  This power does not stack with multiple castings."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P233225542" "You inspire your team with {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2045516122" "You fallen teammate has inspired you with {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P760658812" "+DMG, +To Hit, +DEF(All), Res(Effects)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4246625094" "You have been inspired to Vengeance by a natural leader.  Your chance to hit, Damage and Defense to melee, ranged, smashing and lethal attacks are all increased and you are resistant to Sleep, Hold, Disorient, Immobilize, Confuse, Taunt, Placate and Knockback."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Leaping 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3862815366" "Leaping"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1965845507" "Grants you various travel and combat jumping abilities. Jumping powers tend to be very efficient and use very little endurance compared to other travel powers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Jump Kick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4129595908" "Jump Kick"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1846627950" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash), Foe Knockdown"
// Power Help Text :
"P2634889347" "A good jumping kick attack that may knock foes down. Good if you are looking for another attack power."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3414402548" "Your {PowerName} smacks {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Combat Jumping 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3474890240" "Combat Jumping"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2977037445" "Toggle: Self +Jump, +DEF(All), Res(Immobilization)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3211918353" "While active, Combat Jumping increases your Defense to all attacks, and adds resistance to Immobilization. Moderately increases your jump height and distance while providing good air control."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Long Jump 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3752711311" "Super Jump"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P741067350" "Toggle: Self Long Jump"
// Power Help Text :
"P3956225096" "While this power is active, you can leap great distances and heights, easily jumping over buildings and from rooftop to rooftop!  If you attack a target while this power is on, you will temporarily be reduced to a normal jump height."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Leap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2709404738" "Acrobatics"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1246888341" "Toggle: Self +Res(Knockback, Hold)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1824411948" "While this power is active, you are very nimble and Acrobatic. You can avoid most Knockback effects and are resistant to Hold effects. You must be at least level 14 and have two other Leaping Powers before selecting Acrobatics."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3469491994" "You become more nimble and are less likely to be knocked down or held."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spring Attack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P579280320" "PBAoE Superior DMG(Smashing), Foe Knockdown; Self Teleport"
// Power Help Text :
"P1477802220" "You leap into the air and smash down among ranks of foes in the blink of an eye.  Using this power allows you to jump to a selected area to deal significant smashing damage to all foes near the location you teleport to, most foes that are struck by your Spring Attack will be knocked down.  You must be at least level 14 and have two other Leaping Powers before selecting Spring Attack. Damage: High, Recharge: Very Long."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Medicine 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2705344731" "Medicine"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2548583927" "You become an adept field medic, and can assist your team with basic healing needs. These close range powers should be performed away from combat because they can be interrupted."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Aid Other 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1185560707" "Aid Other"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2240950967" "Close, Ally Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P73132825" "Heals a single targeted ally. This power is interruptible, so you shouldn't use this in combat."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stimulant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2320078554" "Stimulant"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P712178432" "Close, Ally Res(Disorient, Hold, Immobilize, Sleep, Fear, Confuse)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1934578206" "Frees an ally from any Immobilization, Sleep, Disorient, Hold, Fear or Confuse effects and leaves them resistant to such effects for a brief time. Protection will improve with Multiple applications and as you advance in level. This power is interruptible and shouldn't be used in the heat of combat."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2852184886" "You use your {PowerName} and protect {PlayerDest} from Immobilization, Sleep, Disorient, Hold, Fear or Confuse effects."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2764351124" "{PlayerSource} protects you from IImmobilization, Sleep, Disorient, Hold, Fear or Confuse effects with a Stimulant."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1399115484" "Res(Disorient, Hold, Immobilize, Sleep, Fear, Confuse)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P410669498" "The Stimulant provides some resistance to Immobilization, Sleep, Disorient, Hold, Fear or Confuse effects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Aid Self 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P916602661" "Aid Self"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2475714968" "Self Heal, Res(Disorient)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2795550143" "Allows you to heal yourself. This hypo also leaves you wide awake, and resistant to Disorientation effects. This power is interruptible.  Purchasing Aid Self requires the user to be level 14 and possess Aid Other or Stimulant."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3634478623" "You heal yourself for {Damage} hit points with {PowerName}.  You are resistant to Disorient."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Resuscitate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1292134238" "Resuscitate"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1673326674" "Close, Ally Rez"
// Power Help Text :
"P2279452276" "Revives a fallen ally, leaving him with full Hit Points, but no Endurance. The Resuscitated target will be protected from XP Debt for 15 seconds. This power is interruptible. You must be at least level 14 and have two other Medicine Powers before selecting Resuscitate."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3719736088" "You revive {PlayerDest} from the brink of death.  He is very weak and needs to rest."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2589496804" "{PlayerSource} returns you from the brink of death.  However, you are very weak, and must rest for a while to regain your strength."
// DisplayConfirm :
"P3406353573" "{PlayerSource} would like to Resuscitate you.  You will be fully Healed, but have no Endurance for a 30 seconds. Do you Accept?"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3186825077" "You have been Resuscitated.  You are protected from XP Debt for 15 seconds."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Manipulation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2416027123" "Presence"
// DisplayHelp :
"P711584540" "You can manipulate your foes by provoking or intimidating them. A challenging set to master, Presence can get you into trouble if you don't know what you are doing."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Challenge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1442319346" "Challenge"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2749364900" "Ranged, Targeted Taunt"
// Power Help Text :
"P2596193265" "Challenges a foe to attack you. Use this to pull a foe off of an ally in trouble or away from a mob of foes. Not as effective as a typical Scrapper Confront and Challenge powers.  An Accuracy check is required to successfully Challenge a target."
