"P1430204025" "Provoke"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P450419617" "This power attracts the attention of a foe and all those around him. Use this to pull several enemies off of an ally in trouble.  Not as effective as a typical Tanker Taunt powers.  An Accuracy check is required to successfully Challenge a target."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1975468116" "You have been Provoked."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
