"P2283956648" "Intimidate"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P2037953722" "You can threaten a single foe and cause him to helplessly tremble in Fear for a brief while.  Purchasing Intimidate requires the user to be level 14 and possess Challenge or Provoke."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1205126957" "You have been Intimidated."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
