// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1776881406" "Self +Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P2481484113" "You can reduce the recharge time of all powers for 2 minutes. Although Hasten does not cost any Endurance to activate, you can tire easily since your Endurance does not recover more rapidly. After Hasten wears off, you become tired and will lose some Endurance."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3207966633" "Your {PowerName} has increased your rate of attack."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Super Speed 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2257439684" "Super Speed"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P295778697" "Toggle: Self +Speed"
// Power Help Text :
"P1918191772" "You can run at super-human speeds! While running at such speeds, you are a blur, and many foes will not even notice you as you speed past them. If you attack a target while this power is on, you will temporarily be slowed to normal speed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Whirlwind 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4152178509" "Whirlwind"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3487441435" "Toggle: PBAoE, Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1112067027" "You spin around at an amazing speed to create a Whirlwind around yourself. Any foes that enter this Whirlwind will be tossed into the air. You must be at least level 14 and have two other Speed Powers before selecting Whirlwind."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3144030591" "You spin into a {PowerName}, and can now toss your foes in the air like the garbage they are."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Burnout 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P190292040" "Burnout"
// Power Help Text :
"P3350616467" "Burnout allows you to instantly recharge all of your Primary and Secondary powers.  Burnout is very expensive in terms of endurance, and reduces your maximum endurance slightly for 60 seconds after use.   You must be at least level 14 and have two other Speed Powers before selecting Burnout   Recharge: Extremely Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Teleportation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1190958607" "Teleportation"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3277815516" "Grants you various teleportation abilities."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Recall Friend 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P812562171" "Recall Friend"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
// Power AttackerHit Message :
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2686822699" "{PlayerSource} has Teleported you."
// DisplayConfirm :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Teleport Foe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2368757613" "Ranged, Teleport Foe"
// Power Help Text :
"P4241980350" "You can Teleport a single foe directly next to yourself. A successful hit must be made in order to Teleport the target, and some powerful foes cannot be Teleported. Enemy players that are teleported will be temporarily out of phase, and cannot be targeted or damaged. This power can be interrupted."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P892658489" "You teleport {PlayerDest}"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Teleport 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P569504987" "Teleport"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3847603555" "You can Teleport long distances. Teleport has no recharge time, and can be reactivated without pause, as long as you have Endurance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Team Teleport 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P98004820" "Team Teleport"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3645308931" "Ranged (Location), Team Teleport"
// Power Help Text :
"P397246853" "You can Teleport yourself and your nearby teammates to a targeted location. Teammates must be in close proximity to you. Team Teleport costs slightly more Endurance than Teleport, but you can Teleport your entire team for no additional cost. You must be at least level 14 and have two other Teleportation Powers before selecting Team Teleport."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4018568147" "You Teleport your Team."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Long Range Teleport 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1151462287" "Long Range Teleport"
// Power Help Text :
"P3155806944" "Long Range Teleport allows you to teleport very long distances, even across city zones.  You must be at least level 14 and have two other Teleportation Powers before selecting Long Range Teleport.  Recharge: Very Long"

