"P3814360547" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Staff Fighting 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1671348127" "Staff Fighting"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3506264074" "You have mastered the art of staff fighting, allowing you to strike at your foes in great sweeping arcs.  Staff Fighting provides a good amount of control effects as well as some self buffs.  By selecting the Staff Mastery power, you will gain access to techniques that further empower your Staff Fighting techniques and grant you useful augmentations that build up as you fight."
// SetAccountTooltip :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mercurial Blow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4212191260" "Mercurial Blow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P974119330" "Melee, Light DMG(Smash), Foe -Def"
// Power Help Text :
"P4091448698" "You strike your foe with a lightning fast blow from  your staff dealing Light Smashing damage.  The attack is so unexpected  that the target's defenses are reduced slightly for a short time.  While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection.    Damage: Light, Recharge: Fast"
