// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Bio Organic Armor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2213685799" "Bio-Organic Armor"
// DisplayHelp :
"P395642751" "Your body is shielded by an incredibly durable Bio-Organic Armor that evolves based upon your environment.  You are also able to siphon genetic data from your foes to empower yourself.  Bio-Organic Armor provides good damage resistance, a fair amount of regeneration and a good number of offensive/debuff power options."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hardened Skin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4278125647" "Hardened Skin"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P705781464" "Self Toggle, +Res(Lethal, Smash, Toxic, Disorient, Sleep)"
// Power Help Text :
"P662241522" "With a little concentration you can cause your skin to be hard as stone and also boost your constitution to reject toxins. While active, this power will boost your resistance to Lethal, Smashing and Toxic damage. Additionally, you will gain resistance to Disorient and Sleep effects.  Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3442343139" "You are now more resistant to Smashing, Lethal and Toxic damage as well as Sleep and Disorient effects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Heightened Metabolism 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P371737136" "Heightened Metabolism"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3736289642" "Auto: Self +Regeneration, +Recovery, +Res(Regen Debuff, End Drain, Slow)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2417990153" "You regenerate health and recover endurance faster than normal due to your Heightened Metabolism. You're also slightly resistant to regeneration debuffs, slow effects and endurance drains.  This power is always active."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Environmental Adaptation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1294605827" "Environmental Adaptation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P171173492" "Self Toggle, +Res(Hold, Knockdown, Immobilize, Psionic, Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2966578239" "Your body can spontaneously adapt to its surroundings and your mind has learned to shield itself from harmful effects by constant exposure to these dangers.  While active you gain moderate resistance to Fire, Cold and Energy damage and gain a small amount of resistance to Psionic and Negative Energy damage.  Additionally you are protected against hold, knockdown and immobilize effects.  Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2438913099" "You are now more resistant to Fire, Cold, Energy and Negative Energy damage and gain protection from hold, knockdown and immobilize effects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : DNA Siphon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P867009152" "DNA Siphon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2427589525" "Click, PBAoE Minor DMG(Lethal/Toxic) Foe -Regen, Taunt, Self +HP, +End"
// Power Help Text :
"P2977801763" "You can siphon genetic material from nearby enemies causing a minor amount of Lethal damage and a minor amount of Toxic damage over time.  Enemies who have remaining health will provide the user with a small boost to health and endurance.  These foes will have their regeneration rate reduced for a short period of time.  Defeated enemies provide a weaker sample of material and thus will boost recovery and regeneration for a short while.  Damage: Minor, Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P586264981" "-DoT(Toxic), -Res(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3994145908" "Your genetic make up has been weakened by the DNA Siphon thus reducing your damage resistance."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2197837186" "{PlayerSource} weakens {PlayerDest} with their {PowerName} causing {Damage} points of Lethal damage and reducing their regeneration rate!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P684714611" "{PlayerSource} weakens you with their {PowerName} causing {Damage} points of Lethal damage and reducing their regeneration rate!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3639937445" "{PlayerSource} weakens {PlayerDest} with their {PowerName} causing {Damage} points of Toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1179568572" "{PlayerSource} weakens you with their {PowerName} causing {Damage} points of Toxic damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2813168458" "Your {PowerName} siphons {Damage} points of health as well as some endurance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Evolution 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3237849648" "Evolution"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P340625404" "Self Toggle, +Res(Lethal, Smash, Fire, Cold, Toxic), Foe -Res(All), Taunt"
// Power Help Text :
"P353901263" "Your Bio-Organic armor reacts when faced with danger by becoming incredibly durable and weakening nearby enemies.  While active, Evolution will grant you a bonus to damage resistance to Lethal, Smashing, Fire, Cold and Toxic damage for each target near you, up to 10 targets.  Nearby foes will also be taunted and have their damage resistance reduced.  Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P101816504" "You will now gain damage resistance when engaged in melee with foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Inexhaustible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P229756431" "Inexhaustible"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1750417937" "Auto: +Max HP, +Max End"
// Power Help Text :
"P885665661" "Your body is constantly evolving and adapting based on what you've been exposed to.  As a result your maximum hit points and endurance have been increased.  Half of this power's bonus to maximum HP and Endurance is not enhanceable, the other half will enhance as normal.  This power is always active."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ablative Carapace 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4003478602" "Ablative Carapace"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2082918473" "Self, +Absorption"
// Power Help Text :
"P3755106635" "When needed, you're able to cause your Bio-Organic Armor to gain a thick, but brittle outer layer that will absorb a large amount of damage before breaking off.  Recharge: Long.  NOTE: THIS POWER'S EFFECTS AND DATA ARE PLACEHOLDER!"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3279287648" "You force your Bio-Organic Armor to become incredibly dense, but brittle for a short time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Genetic Contamination 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2368488805" "Genetic Contamination"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2732587261" "Self +Toxic Damage, Foe -Regen"
// Power Help Text :
"P3213037433" "You're capable of breaking down the genetic material of your foes with a powerful toxin that is produced by your Bio-Organic Armor.  Your damaging attacks from your secondary power set will deal additional toxic damage and affected foes will have their regeneration rate reduced.  If used in a PvP zone, this power will grant a bonus to damage instead of adding additional Toxic damage and reducing regeneration.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1692342927" "You cause your next few attacks to corrupt your foes on the cellular level causing additional Toxic damage and reducing their regeneration rate."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Parasitic Aura 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3204183427" "Parasitic Aura"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1322887088" "PBAoE, Self +Resist(All), +Regeneration, +Recovery, Foe -To Hit, -DMG, -Speed, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3022200253" "By drawing out your enemies' genetic material you are able to increase your own resistance to all types of damage while boosting your regeneration and recovery rate for a short time.  Affected foes will be infected with a parasitic virus that reduces their damage, chance to hit, speed and recharge time for a short while.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1794566065" "Your {PowerName} drains {PlayerDest}'s Endurance!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3739022570" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their {PowerName} and drains some of your Endurance!"

