// Power : Frozen Fists 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3906588637" "Melee, Minor DMG(Cold/Smash), Foe -Recharge, -SPD, -Res (all)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2016337339" "Frozen Fists encrusts your hands in ice, giving them the ability to quickly inflict minor damage on villains. The foe's attack and movement speed is Slowed, due to the chills caused by the cold blows.  This power can bruise an enemy, making them more vulnerable to damage. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"
