"P4070616617" "Hand Clap"
// Power Help Text :
"P3199863299" "You can clap your hands together with such force that you create a deafening shockwave. This shockwave can knock back nearby foes, and they have a chance to become Disoriented due to the shock to the inner ear. Hand Clap deals no damage. Recharge: Slow"
