"P2770525954" "Cone, Special DMG(Psionic), Foe -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3154001553" "This device was built to interfere with Clockwork's energy signals within its conical area of effect. The Wave Scrambler has 30 charges."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P889404595" "The Wave Scrambler has slightly confused you.  Your reflexes (and attack speed) are reduced."
