"P3146827758" "Plasmatic Taser"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1072183231" "Cone, Moderate DMG(Energy/Smash), Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P3440379792" "This non-lethal plasma device that is more effective than a normal Stun Blaster. It unleashes a cone of energy that knocks foes back. The Plasmatic Taser has 45 charges."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P981358139" "The Plasmatic Taser has knocked you down."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Talisman of the Moon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2187648994" "Talisman of the Moon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2145477681" "Cone, Moderate DMG(Negative Energy), Foe -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P858165545" "Issued to you by the folks at MAGI, the Talisman of the Moon can invoke the cover of night to a cone area. All targets in the cone area take damage and have a reduced chance to hit. The Talisman of the Moon will last 1 for hour."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1224174734" "The Talisman of the Moon has reduced your Accuracy."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3064660140" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduce his accuracy!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4278049653" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduce your accuracy!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Antigravity Matrix 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P461681833" "Antigravity Matrix"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P683245215" "Self Toggle Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P2995763422" "This invention allows any person the ability to fly for a short period. This is one of a kind, so don't break it. If you attack a target while this pack is on, your flight speed will be temporarily reduced to Hover speed. The Antigravity Matrix will burn out after 2 hours of use."
// Power AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Tesla Gauntlet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3490191529" "Tesla Gauntlet"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2317245830" "Ranged Moderate DMG(Energy), Foe Sleep -END"
// Power Help Text :
"P1996570278" "This WWII era weapon was used to hold enemy troops at bay. It looks scary to even put on, as it has none of the safety precautions of today's devices. The gauntlet surrounds its target in a fragile electrical field. The Tesla Gauntlet deals minimal damage. It will last for 1 hour."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1014819589" "The Tesla Gauntlet is shocking you, holding you in a temporary Stasis."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Genetic Restabilizer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P7411361" "Genetic Restabilizer"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2120587783" "Ranged, Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P1735267168" "This device can stop mutations and even begin a reversal of the process in certain cases. The effect, however, can temporarily render a victim helpless and unable to defend himself. The Genetic Restabilizer has 12 charges."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1434775080" "The Genetic Restabilizer has locked your muscles, freezing you in place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Freakshow Disguise 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1392663986" "Freakshow Disguise"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P455342195" "Auto: Self Stealth"
// Power Help Text :
"P672761729" "This suit can cause you to look like a member of the Freakshow without actually undergoing the hazardous cybernetic surgery. You can pass completely unnoticed by the Freakshow.  However, if the you take any aggressive actions, your cover will be blown, and the disguise will no longer be effective. Disables the use of Stealth related powers while worn.  This disguise will last 1 hour of real time."
// Power AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Flashbang Grenades 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1610448640" "Flashbang Grenades"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1860197200" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -To Hit, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P1149262935" "These military issue non-lethal grenades explode with a concussive force that leaves all affected targets very vulnerable. Their Accuracy and Defense will be severely reduced. You have 6 grenades."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2083939504" "-To Hit, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3240726090" "You've been partially blinded by the Flashbang Grenades.  Your Accuracy and Defense are reduced."

