"P1843336971" "Stun Blast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4014858439" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1209860351" "This non-lethal blast can knock someone out indefinitely, with little risk of permanent harm. Stun Blast will last for 1 hour."
