"P1415637740" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DoT(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2549524395" "The Napalm Projector spews forth a cone of flames and sets foes on fire. Very accurate and very deadly at medium range. The Napalm Projector has 30 charges."
