// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1546688455" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Recharge -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P337798662" "These gauntlets can fire a spread Electromagnetic Pulse to knock out electronic devices. Foes in the affected area will have their movement and attack speed Slowed. This device will last for  1 hour."
