// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P514141502" "Neural Inhibitor Grenades"
// Power Help Text :
"P2169721166" "These grenades can block the synapses of the brain and slow down the thought processes of multiple targets. Foes in the affected area will have their movement and attack speed severely Slowed. You have 6 grenades."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3767638968" "The aftereffects of the Neural Inhibitor Grenades have left you shaken.  Your Attack speed and Running speed are reduced."

