// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2612060130" "Auto: Self -Regeneration, -Recovery, -HP, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P2284857066" "You have been infected with the Vahzilok Wasting Disease. This disease, introduced by the Vahzilok, is slowly wasting you away. Find a cure, quick! Your Max Hit Points, Endurance, Regeneration, and Recovery have been reduced."

