"P4256113400" "Ranged, Clockwork Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P1903943198" "This device was invented by Positron, specifically to interfere with the signals the Clockwork King uses to animate his minions. This is the prototype model, and has only one shot."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Clockwork Immobilizer MkII 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P211222913" "Clockwork Immobilizer MkII"
// Power Help Text :
"P3745629706" "This device was invented by Positron, specifically to interfere with the signals the Clockwork King uses to animate his minions. This is the upgraded model. It still has only one shot, but should be more effective."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Clockwork Immobilizer MkIII 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1202795022" "Clockwork Immobilizer MkIII"
// Power Help Text :
"P3658590100" "This device was invented by Positron, specifically to interfere with the signals the Clockwork King uses to animate his minions. This is the Mark III model. It still has only one shot, but should be more effective and last a longer amount of time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Clockwork Immobilizer MkIV 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2174684276" "Clockwork Immobilizer MkIV"
// Power Help Text :
"P2160964945" "This device was invented by Positron, specifically to interfere with the signals the Clockwork King uses to animate his minions. This is the most powerful version, and should be effective against the Clockwork King himself. Positron apologizes that it still only has one shot."

