"P3012635767" "Med Kit"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3099934834" "This Med Kit allows you to heal 1/4 of your hit points. The Med Kit has 8 uses."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ring of Pain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1894374898" "Ring of Pain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2552344474" "Ranged, Foe -DEF, Self DoT"
// Power Help Text :
"P4019301141" "The Ring of Pain is a dark device. It can severely reduce a target's Defense, at the cost of the owner's health. As the target's Defense is lowered, you will continue to lose Hit Points until you deactivate the ring. The Ring of Pain can remain active for about 10 minutes before it is exhausted of its negative energy."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2455344214" "Ring of Pain severely reduces the defense of {PlayerDest}, but continue drains you of Hit Points as long as it is active."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1495070103" "The spell of the Ring of Pain is reducing your Defenses."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ace of Spades 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1788117315" "Ace of Spades"
// Power Help Text :
"P601864409" "You kept the Ace of Spades from the Dead Man's Deck as a memento. Its curse can severely reduce a target's Defense, at the cost of the owner's health. As the target's Defense is lowered, you will continue to lose Hit Points until you deactivate the card. The Ace of Spades can remain active for about 15 minutes before it is exhausted of its negative energy."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1087989226" "The curse of the Ace of Spades reduces the defense of {PlayerDest}, but continue drains you of Hit Points as long as it is active."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2734599665" "The curse of the Ace of Spades is reducing your Defenses."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Scroll of Ruin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4124485360" "Scroll of Ruin"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P289624453" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P2475307817" "This incantation will drastically reduce the Defense of all foes in the affected area. The affected foes become vulnerable and incredibly easy to hit. This scroll possesses powerful dark magics, and its effects are almost impossible to resist or avoid. The Scroll of Ruin can only be used once."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3965985002" "The Scroll of Ruin has drastically reduced the defense of {PlayerDest}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Geometric Gauntlets 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2883371889" "Geometric Gauntlets"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P16173388" "Ranged, Foe Immobilize, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P872187593" "This Geometric Gauntlet creates a localized gravitational field strong enough to Immobilize a single foe. The target can still attack, but cannot move. It is also powerful enough to bring down flying entities. There are 75 charges."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4105081437" "Immobilize, -Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3721817202" "The Geometric Field is holding you in place!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Manifold Resonator 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1659275156" "Manifold Resonator"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3221069016" "Self Teleport +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2947222885" "After Teleporting, you will remain intangible for a while. During this time, you cannot activate any other powers. As you slowly phase into normal space, you will remain partially visible for a brief time. If you attack while partially visible, your Accuracy will be reduced, but your Defense will be improved."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3620974508" "You have successfully teleported and are phase shifted.  You cannot be hit and are hard to see, however you cannot attack."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Resonance Disrupter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1881056142" "Resonance Disrupter"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3162452319" "Toggle: Self Stealth, +DEF, -HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P2145637123" "The Resonance Disrupter bends light around you to make you completely Invisible. While this power is active, you are all but impossible to detect. If you attack while Invisible, you will be detected, although you will still have a huge bonus to Defense. This technology is unstable, and you will take damage over time as long as it is active.  Will not work with other self-targeted concealment related powers such as Stealth or Invisibility."
// DisplayPowerDefenseFloat :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Jump Pack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1536342359" "Self Toggle JumpPack"
// Power Help Text :
"P1061555926" "This Jump Pack grants you the ability to not only jump great distances, but also jump and gain altitude in mid air! The Jump Pack has limited fuel, and will be exhausted after five minutes of use."
// Power AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Thermite Cannon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P118878082" "Thermite Cannon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3170618329" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DoT(Plasma)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3793316665" "The Thermite Plasma Cannon is a Rikti weapon. The Plasma is relatively cool, and only moderately dangerous.  However, it has been discovered that Thermite Plasma is deadly to the Hydra. It is best to save the weapon's limited charges for defeating the Hydra."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2761466870" "The Thermite Cannon has enveloped you in Plasma!  You are burning."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3988868767" "Your Thermite Plasma Cannon scorched {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Plasma damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1451262130" "{PlayerSource} burns you for {Damage} points of plasma damage with his Thermite Plasma Cannon!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P707093785" "Your Thermite Plasma Cannon scorched {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Fire damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Particle Cannon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3046470625" "Particle Cannon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P843530210" "Ranged, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2136944739" "The Particle Cannon is a heavy Rikti weapon that can reverse the polarity of an entity brought through a dimensional rift, sending it back to its own universe.  Against other targets, it has no effect. The Particle Cannon can send the Hydra Head back to its dimension. The particle beam is slow, and must be held on the target for a long time. The Particle Cannon has limited charges, so use it wisely."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2689111849" "Your Particle Cannon blasts {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1226702143" "{PlayerSource} blasts you for {Damage} points of damage with his Particle Cannon!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dimensional Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3611437819" "Dimensional Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1796005904" "Auto: Self -Recovery, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P2809627968" "This device ties directly into your biological energy to protect you against the hazardous environment in the vortex. Because it is powered by your own vitals, it completely drains your Endurance. However, the Dimensional Shield will replenish your Hit Points more rapidly than normal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Empowered Shard of the Wheel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P403617704" "Empowered Shard of the Wheel"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P888955577" "This broken piece of an ancient artifact has been empowered by the Banished Pantheon. While carrying it, you can scorch your enemies with your hands.  It lasts for 90 minutes."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2749309753" "You land a critical hit with your {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of fire damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Empowered Center of the Wheel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P471701978" "Empowered Center of the Wheel"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P1843803176" "This metal rod has been empowered by the Banished Pantheon. While carrying it, you can summon a Sword of Flame.  It lasts for 90 minutes."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3262294968" "{PlayerSource} hacks you with his mighty {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
