"P3246999775" "Empowered Piece of the Wheel"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3287692799" "This broken piece of an ancient artifact has been empowered by the Banished Pantheon. While carrying it, you have the power to launch a torrent of flames at your opponents.  It lasts for 90 minutes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Empowered Linchpin of the Wheel 
