"P88441133" "Toggle: Self +Res(Smash, Lethal, Energy, Negative)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1567402507" "The linchpin of the Wheel of Destruction has been empowered by the Banished Pantheon. While carrying it, you can summon a cloak of flames to protect you from harm. While active, you take less damage from Smashing, Lethal, Energy, and Negative Energy attacks.  It lasts for 90 minutes."
