// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Psychic Cleaver 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3639897505" "Psychic Cleaver"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P974008996" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3572776157" "After drinking Cadao Kestral's magic draught, you have the ability to destroy the Madame of Mystery, the psychic projection of Madeline Casey.  This is the only way to free Madeleine's soul from the Carnival's hold. Psychic Cleaver has 500 charges. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2991583848" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of enchanted damage and Slow him!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
