"P2663184169" "Coolant"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2278225876" "Close, Fix Reactor"
// Power Help Text :
"P2096056410" "This Coolant can be used to cool and help stabilize the Reactor Core. There are 20 charges."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3119631387" "You cool {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Idol of Lughebu 
