"P3203627492" "Idol of Lughebu"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P194590156" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe -To Hit, Self +HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P1800267155" "When you rescued Suzanne Trent, she gave you this idol she found in the Pantheon's lair. While carrying it, you have the ability to drain the life from nearby foes, increasing your own Hit Points. The idol must be returned to the MAGI vault within 24 hours."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P278813324" "Your Accuracy has been reduced by the magic of the Idol of Lughebu."
