"P2512858669" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Energy), Target Immobilize"
// Power Help Text :
"P2987111847" "MAGI's Galaxy City liaison Gregor Richardson has bestowed upon you a spell that brings forth a strange white light from your hands. This light is painful to the shadows, and can hold them in place while dealing Energy damage to them. There are 75 charges."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1433855085" "DoT(Energy), Immobilize"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3708553442" "The Fettering Nimbus has locked you in place and is damaging you."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1969136168" "Your {PowerName} burns {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3249152586" "{PlayerSource} burns you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Crey Narcotic 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3086697227" "Crey Narcotic"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4086982822" "Auto: Self -Recovery, -Speed, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P2718355113" "The Crey scientists have injected you with a narcotic that slows your movement speed, attack speed, and Endurance Recovery! After completing your mission, you should seek help from your contact. If you cannot reach your contact, the effect should wear off."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Terra Volta Exposure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P775821617" "Terra Volta Exposure"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1246633515" "Glow"
// Power Help Text :
"P645819224" "You have been exposed to the strange and powerful radiation of the Terra Volta Reactor Core.  Its energy has left your irradiated and glowing.  There seems to be no negative side effects from this glow, and it will probably wear off soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Wedding Band 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3263329587" "Wedding Band"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1871444174" "Toggle: Self +Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2505001700" "This ring contains the power of Stephanie Peebles' love for her late husband, Stephen. When invoked, this power will partially protect you from all damage types, including Psionics. After about 2 hours of on time, Stephanie will recall the ring magically."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Wedding Band FB 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P867925299" "Wedding Band (Echo)"
// Power Help Text :
"P557381222" "This is a Time Echo of a ring containing the power of Stephanie Peebles' love for her late husband, Stephen. When invoked, this power will partially protect you from all damage types, including Psionics. After about 5 minutes of on time, Stephanie will recall the ring magically."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Warwolf Whistle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3473804012" "Warwolf Whistle"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3672847964" "Summon War Wolf"
// Power Help Text :
"P100668552" "Stephanie Peebles has granted you the ability to call forth a mighty Warwolf to fight at your side. The Warwolf can be buffed and healed, but is an unwilling companion and will not follow you through doors or into new zones. You may summon 5 wolves, one at a time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Warwolf Whistle FB 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P305673413" "Warwolf Whistle (Echo)"
// Power Help Text :
"P305708944" "This is a Time Echo of the ability Stephanie Peebles granted you to call forth a mighty Warwolf to fight at your side. The Warwolf can be buffed and healed, but is an unwilling companion and will not follow you through doors or into new zones. You may summon 2 wolves, one at a time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Holy Shotgun Shells 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P359512202" "Holy Shotgun Shells"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P672869379" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Lethal)/Special vs. Pantheon, Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P694995522" "Tobias Hansen gave you these holy shotgun shells to aid you in your efforts against the Banished Pantheon. These blessed shotgun shells do extra damage to Undead villains.  Use them wisely, for you have only 75 shells."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2180169402" "{PlayerSource} blasts your with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3745783078" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of special damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Electromagnetic Grenades 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P319800412" "Electromagnetic Grenades"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3026403062" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DMG(Energy)/Special vs. Robots"
// Power Help Text :
"P1685301965" "These Electromagnetic Grenades, found in a Council base, generate a massive pulse of electromagnetic energy that is especially effective against robots.  You have 30 grenades."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3763882574" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1847101284" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for an extra {Damage} points of energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Nictus Fragment 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P27719367" "Nictus Fragment"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3536379890" "This Nictus Fragment allows you tap the primal forces of your Nictus power to create an Essence Draining conduit between a foe and yourself. This will transfer Hit Points from your enemy to yourself. Foes drained in this manner have their attack and movement speed reduced. The fragment will allow you to perform this attack about 75 times before becoming useless. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P376783017" "The Nictus Fragment has drained you, leaving your Attack speed and running speed reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Rock 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2541425820" "Rock"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2502731832" "Ranged Smash"
// Power Help Text :
"P2647994244" "You got a rock."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2325749990" "You hit {PlayerDest} with a Rock for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : SnowBall 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3688486273" "Can be used on friend and foe alike. Although there are no lasting effects when these frozen missiles are hurled, who doesn't love throwing a snowball. Snowballs should last 12 days. Happy Holidays!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Holiday Rocket Pack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P118955187" "Holiday Rocket Pack"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P4272625916" "This Rocket Pack allows you to fly for a short period. If you attack a target while this pack is on, your flight speed will be temporarily reduced to Hover speed. This Rocket Pack will last for 30 days."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : LKT-1700 Rocket Pack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Help Text :
"P1167240478" "Delusion, Inc., the same company that makes all of Rose Star's gadgets, has mass-produced the LKT-1700 ducted-fan jet pack. This stylish jet pack enables you with the power of Flight. It will last for 20 days from the day you received it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Build SnowBeast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P30408486" "Build SnowBeast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1270399854" "Summon Snow Beast"
// Power Help Text :
"P1578490910" "Creates one Snow Beast to do your bidding.  Snow Beasts desire nothing more than to freeze everything they come into contact with.  You may only have 1 Snow Beast at a time and he will last for 5 minutes before melting.  You cannot bring your snow beast across zones. You may have up to 3 copies of this power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Toy Bat 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3207869624" "Toy Bat"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3439946572" "Minor Smash DMG (Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2904681614" "This bat is covered with a soft foam-like material cushioning its impact. The toy bat does Trivial damage to villains, but can also be used against allies for no damage. And lets face it, some of your 'friends' deserve it. It can be used up to 99 times before breaking."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1534320090" "You hit {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P295419987" "{PlayerSource} hits you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P940528378" "You hit {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P260398696" "{PlayerSource} hits you with a {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Vomit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2976651163" "Vomit"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3088124383" "PBAoE, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3856624666" "One of the all time classic gags, this rubber vomit looks (and smells!) realistic enough to fool anyone.  Using it has a good chance of making anyone who sees you use it get ill.  Great fun at parties!   Recharge: Medium"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2041433266" "You get sick, causing {PlayerDest} to become ill."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2773969969" "{PlayerSource} becomes ill in front of you, causing you to vomit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Extinguisher 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1172632720" "Extinguisher"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P526474245" "Fire Extinguisher (Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2649504800" "The Fire Fighter 3000, developed by Positron, uses a potassium bicarbonate powder to smother flames. It has 15 charges."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3767780786" "The Fire Marshal has issued you this Fire Extinguisher.  This Extinguisher has 15 charges, so be sure to make every shot count."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3347500540" "You extinguish the fire for {Damage} points of damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Large Extinguisher 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P837033639" "Large Extinguisher"
// Power Help Text :
"P231043272" "The Fire Fighter 4000 has a longer range than the 3000, Positron's earlier model. It also puts out flames faster. Unfortunately, it only has 9 charges."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3112143488" "The Fire Marshal has issued you this Fire Extinguisher.  This Extinguisher has 9 charges, so be sure to make every shot count."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Amy's Ward 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2192938976" "Amy's Ward"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4292817087" "Summon Amy Jonsson"
// Power Help Text :
"P749610000" "This small amulet, given to you by the young witch Katie, will allow you to summon the astral projection of Amy Jonsson five times.  You may only manifest one projection of Amy at a time.  If you try to summon a second while the first is still active, the amulet will fail and lose a charge."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2009136484" "Amy Jonsson's Astral form has answered your summons!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Divining Rod 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3450722684" "Divining Rod"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P645292498" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Energy)/Special vs. Ghosts"
// Power Help Text :
"P3623538492" "It's hard to believe this flimsy device can be as powerful as Skipper LeGrange claims. According to him, it measures the paranormal qualities of its subjects, often with dramatic results. The Divining Rod has 20 charges."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Rune of Warding 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3602486920" "Rune of Warding"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2814949529" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Energy)/Special vs. Fey"
// Power Help Text :
"P4210957764" "After you rescued the village's Book of Runes from the Fir Bolg, Mayor Gordon Bower asked you to study the Rune of Warding. It should help you battle the strange creatures of Croatoa, but knowledge of the rune will fade after 3 days."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Bow and Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P970959154" "Bow and Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3057787756" "Given to you by Waylon McCrane, this bow is crafted of a fine metal alloy. You have 75 arrows."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P45458188" "Your {PowerName} pounds {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1705389622" "{PlayerSource} pounds {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Iron Blade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2885809703" "Iron Blade"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P4209502845" "According to Buck Salinger, it's a well known fact that Fey creatures such as the Fir Bolg, Red Caps and Tuatha fear iron more than any other substance. This iron blade you recovered may be of some use against them. You may carry it for 3 days before returning it to the village."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3716990204" "Your Iron Blade poisons {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of toxic damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : V_Shivan Shard 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P736775029" "Shivan Shard"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3529803329" "Summon Shivan"
// Power Help Text :
"P3849998341" "Using this weird 'Shiva Shard' while near the ground allows you to summon forth a powerful Shivan Decimator to fight at your side. The Shivan can be buffed and healed, but is an unwilling companion and will not follow you through doors or into new zones. The Shard can summon 5 Shivans before it is drained."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : V_Shivan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2665842069" "Click: Shapeshift, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2573645578" "Using this weird 'Shiva Shard' allows you to temporarily take on the aspect of the bizarre Shivans that infest Bloody Bay. In this pseudo-ectoplasmic state you will not have access to any of your powers, but you'll gain incredible strength, resistance, endurance, and the ability to hurl bolts of weird radioactive energy. However, after the transformation wares off, you will be drained of a lot of your Endurance. You can transform 5 times and the effect will last 2 minutes.  This temp power will fade after 1 hour, even if you have not used all 5 charges."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2193328313" "Shivan Protoplasmic energy consumes your flesh, transforming you into a horrific Shivan beast.  You cannot use your own powers in this form, but you now have access to Shivan Attack powers."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2360580948" "Transforming into a Shivan has drained some of your Endurance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : V_Shivan Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3217671950" "Shivan Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2104298090" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Lehtal/Energy), Foe -DEF, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P2457782525" "The Shivan Contaminated Strike is a moderate melee attack that releases radioactive energy on impact, which can Knock Down foes, and reduce a target's Defense. This temp power is only accessible while in Shivan form."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3870140893" "The Shivan Contaminated Strike has weakened your Defenses!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : V_Shivan Smash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P211404333" "Shivan Smash"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2420260869" "Melee, Heavy DMG(Lehtal/Energy), Foe -DEF, -Fly, Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P1442355860" "Shivan Radioactive Smash is powerful melee attack that can often Disorient or Knock Down opponents. Radioactive Smash can also bring down fliers, and reduce their defense. This temp power is only accessible while in Shivan form."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P494774851" "You have been knocked down by a Shivan Radioactive Smash attack.  You are Disoriented and cannot fly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : V_Shivan Bolt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3764153087" "Shivan Bolt"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P2060595565" "A very quick, but low damage attack. Shivan Neutrino Blast can reduce the target's Defense.  This temp power is only accessible while in Shivan form."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2247395871" "Your Defense has been reduced by the Shivan Neutrino Bolt."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P292891798" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage, and reduce his Defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1652898463" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and reduces your Defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : V_Shivan Beam 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1007565220" "Shivan Beam"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P2388700808" "You can emit a beam of X-Ray energy from your eyes, dealing moderate Energy damage. This attack can bypass some defenses and can reduce the target's Defense.  This temp power is only accessible while in Shivan form."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1979858085" "Your Defense has been reduced by the Shivan X-Ray Beam."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : V_Shivan Haze 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4082578100" "Shivan Haze"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2021752215" "Close, Moderate DMG(Energy), Foe -DEF, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P950268576" "A short range conical blast of free electrons. This attack can bypass some of a target's defenses and reduce the target's Defense. It can also knock some targets down.  This temp power is only accessible while in Shivan form."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1270757862" "The Shivan Electron Haze has reduced your Defenses."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1600302355" "Your {PowerName} blasts {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage, and reduces his Defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : V_Shivan Bomb 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P227798767" "Shivan Bomb"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P2980361211" "This devastating attack lobs an explosive sphere of deadly radiation, damaging the target and all nearby foes. Shivan Neutron Bomb can bypass some of a target's defenses and reduce the target's  This temp power is only accessible while in Shivan form."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P324208689" "The Shivan Neutron Bomb has reduced your Defenses."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2774666676" "Your {PowerName} explodes on {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage, and reduce his Defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : V_Ore Extractor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P67899814" "Ore Extractor"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1055544019" "Extract Ore"
// Power Help Text :
"P527744188" "This stainless steel tool allows you to safely collect and store fragments of the Shiva meteors. Once collected, you'll need to take the shards to a processing station and transform them into Shiva Samples. These are then taken to the Contact who gave you the extractor. You must be in close proximity to the Meteorite to extract the ore.  Extracting the Ore is interruptible, so if you are hit or more, you will need to try again."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P170793323" "You extract the ore from the Shivan Meteorite."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Remote Camera 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P443815016" "Remote Camera"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P190256210" "Auto: Spectator Mode"
// Power Help Text :
"P1463835893" "You are in Spectator Mode and controlling a remote camera. You can not use any of your powers, and you can only communicate with other spectators.  You can fly around and observe the Arena Event, but your camera can be shot down.  If your camera is shot, you will be returned to the Arena Lobby."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Respawn 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P657687027" "Respawn"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3267124548" "Immunity"
// Power Help Text :
"P575690768" "After being defeated in the Arena, you will respawn invulnerable and only able to affect yourself for 5 seconds."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Respawn_Dead 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3442078560" "Respawn Dead"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Buff_Period 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1884655051" "Buff Period"
// Power Help Text :
"P1248759465" "After entering a new Arena match, you will have a 60 second period in which you can buff yourself and your allies, but not affect your enemies or move."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disable Travel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1641035138" "Disable Travel"
// Power Help Text :
"P3131071114" "While in this mode, you cannot Fly or Teleport, and your maximum run speed and jump height will be restricted."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disable Stealth 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P885425021" "Disable Stealth"
// Power Help Text :
"P75435868" "While in this mode, Stealth will no longer function against other players."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disable Pool 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1552457791" "Disable Pool"
// Power Help Text :
"P2813902987" "While in this mode, you cannot activate any Pool powers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disable Temp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4165635187" "Disable Temp"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3434071072" "Disable Temp Powers"
// Power Help Text :
"P2635169998" "While in this mode, you cannot activate any Temporary powers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Enable Arena Temp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P695548341" "Enable Arena Temp"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2499550716" "Enable Arena Temp Powers"
// Power Help Text :
"P2511412829" "While in this mode, you can activate any Arena-only Temporary powers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disable Travel TF 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1077361898" "Disable Travel TF"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disable Pool TF 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2581712480" "Disabled Pool Powers"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disable Epic TF 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P987699114" "Disabled Epic Powers"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disable Temp TF 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P476115509" "Disabled Temporary Powers"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disable Temp Dead 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3542421792" "Disable Temp Dead"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disable Inspiration 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2519552833" "Disable Inspiration"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P440636254" "Disable Inspirations"
// Power Help Text :
"P3750174134" "While in this mode, you cannot activate any Inspirations."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disable Small Inspiration 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2621955112" "Disable Small Inspiration"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disable Medium Inspiration 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2184162957" "Disable Medium Inspiration"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disable Large Inspiration 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1996775803" "Disable Large Inspiration"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disable Special Inspiration 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3165531945" "Disable Special Inspiration"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Unlimited Endurance 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4211421659" "Unlimited Endurance"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P765123804" "Endurance Discount, +Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P928102814" "While in this mode, you have virtually unlimited Endurance Recovery."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hummingbird Pack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1102346043" "Raptor Pack"
// Power Help Text :
"P155862282" "This backpack grants any person the ability to fly for a short period. If you attack a target while this pack is on, your flight speed will be temporarily reduced to Hover speed. The Raptor Pack will burn out after 2 minutes of use. You can only carry 1 Raptor Pack at a time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Raptor Pack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Low-G Pack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P689781289" "Low-G Pack"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P2610595683" "The Low-G Pack allows you to leap great distances and heights, easily jumping over buildings and from rooftop to rooftop! The Low-G Pack will burn out after 2 minutes of use. You can only carry 1 Low-G Pack at a time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Jaunt Initializer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2737900070" "Jaunt Initializer"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3028098260" "You can Teleport long distances. Jaunt Initializer has no recharge time, and can be reactivated without pause. The Jaunt Initializer has 5 charges. You can only carry 1 Jaunt Initializer at a time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stealth Suit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3503143410" "Stealth Suit"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P1634928008" "Stealth Suit blends into your environment and can only be seen at very close range. If you attack while using this power, you will be discovered and lose your defense bonus. While Invisible, your movement is Slowed. The Stealth Suit will burn out after 2 minutes of use. The Stealth Suit will not work with any other form of self-targeted Concealment power.  You can only carry 1 Stealth Suit at a time."
// Power AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stun Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P994909197" "Stun Grenade"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4207810426" "Ranged (Targeted AoE) Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P2005245620" "This Stun Grenade can Disorient all foes around the target. You can only carry a max of 6 Stun Grenades at a time."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1563157976" "You have been Disoriented by a Stun Grenade."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Web Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P436645515" "Upon impact, the Web Grenade expels a strong, tenuous, and very sticky substance that can Immobilize most targets. This non-lethal device deals no damage and does not prevent targets from attacking, although their attack rate is Slowed. The Web can bring down flying entities and halts jumping. You can only carry a max of 6 Web Grenades at a time."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Pet Arena HP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P328800147" "Pet Arena HP"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1167900703" "3X HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P1656431682" "This power gives entities in the Pet Arena 3 times normal HP."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Loa Bone 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3501656169" "Loa Bone"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2349712610" "Summon Zombie"
// Power Help Text :
"P1686291284" "You have received this magic wand as a reward from Mr. Bocor for your assistance. It has the power to summon undead minions to serve you. It may be used 5 times before its magical energies are exhausted."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summoning Amulet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1237688155" "Summoning Amulet"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P714949356" "Summon Imp"
// Power Help Text :
"P2226029296" "This is a gold amulet with various mystic symbols etched in silver. After saving his life from his former Hellion allies, Billie gives you this amulet that was the cause of all the contention. It allows you to summon a Fire Imp for a short duration. This may be done 5 times before the magic is exhausted."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ghostslayer Rifle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P935655716" "Ghostslayer Rifle"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2401919278" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Lethal)/Special vs. Ghosts"
// Power Help Text :
"P60301937" "This is an assault rifle with special ammo. The bullets are specially made to affect ethereal entities like ghosts and spirits. 50 bursts can be fired before the ammo is exhausted."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2159552262" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P365716188" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of special damage!"

