// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1514554189" "Targeted AoE Lethal/Smash, Special vs. Ghosts"
// Power Help Text :
"P952675651" "This is a special anti-spirit bomb used to destroy ethereal entities like ghosts and spirits. You have enough for 6 charges."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2179375267" "{PlayerSource} hits you with a Grenade for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1285930923" "{PlayerSource} hits you with a Grenade for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
