// Display Name :
"P119301091" "Nictus Gravitic Emanation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2715767264" "Ranged (Cone), Minor DMG(Negative), Foe Disorient, Knockback, -Recharge, -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P4266826275" "This is a power granted by the Nictus inhabiting your body, allowing you to emit a cone attack on your enemies.  This power lasts two hours."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1967383444" "Disorient, -Recharge, -SPD"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
