"P3949211795" "Nictus Absorption"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1751429594" "Auto: Self +Res (Energy,Negative)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2898219780" "This is a power granted by the Nictus inhabiting your body, giving you a certain degree of damage resistance. This power lasts 2 hours."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2331093261" "This is a power granted by the Nictus inhabiting your body, giving you a certain degree of damage resistance.  This power lasts 90 minutes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Nictus Shadow Step 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1870694975" "Nictus Shadow Step"
// Power Help Text :
"P4188816536" "This is a power granted by the Nictus inhabiting your body, allowing you to teleport short distances.  This power lasts two hours."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Goldbricker Rocket Pack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1529216244" "Goldbricker Rocket Pack"
// Power Help Text :
"P3772462490" "This is a stolen rocket pack you stole as evidence that Dr. Aeon has modified them on the sly. It has enough fuel for 90 minutes of flight."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stolen SMG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1151852043" "Stolen SMG"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3473305322" "This is a Submachine gun stolen from a crate that was part of an arms shipment. You may fire 10 bursts from the SMG before it is exhausted."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3226197918" "Your Defense has been reduced by fire from the Advanced Submachine Gun."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3053434217" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and lower their Defenses!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3166766318" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and lowers your defenses."
