"P3389011485" "High Explosive"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1515350353" "Place Mine: PBAoE, Superior DMG(Lethal/Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2504359771" "This is a bundle of high-explosives with a proximity sensor on it. You have 10 explosives."

