"P4039533355" "Targeted AoE Lethal/Smash, DoT(Toxic), Foe -Res(All), -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P2050213285" "These are venom grenades used by Arachnos Longfangs. You have 3 grenades."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4154695595" "Your Resistances and Defense have been weakened by the Venom Grenade."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2638990817" "The {PowerName} poisons you for {Damage} points of Toxic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sky Raider Flight Pack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2109356033" "Sky Raider Flight Pack"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1313572122" "Toggle: Self Fly, -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P2432851687" "This high-tech device looks like a backpack with wings and a harness. It allows you to fly for the duration of the air assault. It has enough fuel for 60 minutes of flight."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Holographic Projector 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P459742190" "Holographic Projector"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3978072165" "Auto: Shapeshift, +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3178390966" "This high-tech device has a number of buttons and dials on it. It projects a holographic image of a Council Galaxy officer in your place. It has enough power for three real time hours."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spirit Potion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2917459168" "Spirit Potion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2250716377" "Self Intangible"
// Power Help Text :
"P3192491824" "Within this gourd carved with various runes is an acrid-smelling concoction which allows an imbiber to become a spirit for a short period of time.  The imbiber cannot attack or be attacked while in spirit form. There are 3 doses in the flask, lasting 60 seconds each."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3206175017" "You enter the spirit world. You are now intangible, are hard to see, and cannot affect or be affected by those in normal space."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Blackwand 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P787735558" "Ranged, High DMG(Negative)"
// Power Help Text :
"P659057102" "This is the Blackwand, a foul magical artifact created by the Archmage Tarixus. This black metal wand feels cold in your hand, and glows with dark arcane energies. The Blackwand may be used 10 times before it is exhausted."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Soul Essence 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3088286033" "Soul Essence"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P752530022" "Self +Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P3149527188" "This essence was taken from a Circle of Thorns altar, revitalizing you. This power lasts for 15 minutes."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P4054535014" "Your Endurance Recovery increases."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P43521278" "This essence was taken from a Circle of Thorns altar, revitalizing you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
