// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P173103164" "Nullifier Gun Prototype"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2651678694" "Foe -End, -Rec, Detoggle"
// Power Help Text :
"P1074685309" "This futuristic-looking rifle has energy readings on its side, but appears to be jury-rigged with all manner of cables and dials. It can be used to nullify superpowers for a short duration. It can be used 5 times before the energy pack is depleted."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3267513923" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} draining them of their Endurance and lowering their Endurance Recovery."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1631134216" "{PlayerSource} drains your Endurance and lowers your Endurance Recovery!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1799220205" "The {PowerName} temporarily disables one of your powers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Nullifier Gun Prototype FB 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3200856615" "This is a Time Echo of a futuristic-looking rifle which has energy readings on its side, but appears to be jury-rigged with all manner of cables and dials. It can be used to nullify superpowers for a short duration. It can be used 5 times before the energy pack is depleted."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Nullifier Gun Mk I 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2096037885" "Nullifier Gun Mk I"
// Power Help Text :
"P2069622259" "This futuristic-looking rifle has energy readings on its side. It can be used to nullify superpowers for a short duration. It can be used 5 times before the energy pack is depleted."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Nullifier Gun Mk I_FB 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
