"P2984054206" "Nullifier Gun Mk I (Echo)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1328793833" "This is a Time Echo of a futuristic-looking rifle has energy readings on its side. It can be used to nearly nullify superpowers for a short duration. It can be used 5 times before the energy pack is depleted."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Minor Mutation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P260170236" "Minor Mutation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P2791415558" "When you found Dr. Rossi's Mutate-O-Tron, you resolved to use it on yourself rather than bring it back to Darla Mavis. Your mind has been somewhat enhanced, though you cannot be sure the effect will be permanent."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2363336857" "The Minor Mutation has slowed your Attack rate."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P430673265" "Your {PowerName} rips the mind of {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of psionic damage and slows his attack speed!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P567619562" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of psionic damage and slows your attack speed!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2526907241" "Your {PowerName} rips the mind of {PlayerDest} for an extra {Damage} points of psionic damage due to your origin!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2575188478" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with a {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of psionic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Psionic Activator 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P102312025" "Psionic Activator"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P194239184" "This high-tech device was given to you by Psimon Omega. When used on victims of Rikti experimentation it activates their latent psychic powers but causing them to fly into a blind rage and attack your nearest enemy. This device has 20 charges."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1841613956" "You have been Disoriented by a Psionic Activator."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2059621674" "Your {PowerName} continues to deal an extra {Damage} points of psionic damage due to your origin!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Void Hunter Rifle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P37263432" "Void Hunter Rifle"
// Power Help Text :
"P281478065" "This sleek rifle was taken from a Void Hunter, those mysterious beings that hunt the Kheldians and Nictus.  It has been modified to be especially effective against certain Kheldians, although it will still work to a lesser extent on other beings. The rifle has 10 shots before it runs out of ammo."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2166696133" "Your attack and movement rate have been slowed by the Void Hunter Rifle."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2010029587" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P209998868" "{PlayerSource} blasts your with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P709873206" "You devastate {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for and extra {Damage} points of Nicti damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2586772732" "{PlayerSource} devastates your with his {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of Nicti damage!  There is something in that weapon that is tuned to your Kheldian energy signature!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Soul Crystal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1963363244" "Soul Crystal"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1610324294" "Summon Spectre"
// Power Help Text :
"P2386697979" "This intricately carved crystal glows from an unearthly inner light. You can hear the voices of ancient souls trapped within its confines, begging for release and promising their service."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Prison Crystal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1715701656" "Prison Crystal"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2441202768" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Negative), Self +HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P3812102484" "This intricately carved piece of dark crystal is cold to the touch, as if it were trying to draw the life from your hands. You can almost hear the voices of souls trapped within for thousands of years of torment."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3059171138" "You drain {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P828708027" "You gain {Damage} hit points from the {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Coral Shards 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P829647123" "Coral Shards"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P130790662" "Cone Lethal, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P576431641" "These shards of living coral are taken from the Eye of the Leviathan, a gargantuan creature in the Temple of the Waters. These magical coral shards can be hurled at your enemies with devastating effect. You can use the coral shards for 3 days before the magic fades from them."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3047061899" "Sprays shards of coral at your foe."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Coral Club 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1724031768" "Coral Hammer"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2894099118" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash/Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1227964591" "This Hammer of living coral is formed from a piece of the Eye of the Leviathan, a gargantuan creature in the Temple of the Waters.  This coral Hammer can be used to smite your enemies with devastating effect.  You can use the Coral Hammer for 3 days."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2127351565" "Melee Smash, Med Dam"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3011182404" "Smash 'em in the head with this Coral Hammer"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P31706344" "{PlayerSource} smashes you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4155244340" "{PlayerSource} smashes you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Coral Amulet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4180783011" "Coral Amulet"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3770431498" "Summon Coralax Guardian"
// Power Help Text :
"P1779545012" "This amulet of living coral is formed from a piece of the Eye of the Leviathan, a gargantuan creature in the Temple of the Waters. This coral amulet can be used to summon coral guardians to fight for you."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P147909183" "The Coralax Guardian answers the summons of your Coral Amulet."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Enchantment of Serafina 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P457819019" "Enchantment of Serafina"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2800661100" "PBAoE, Ally +Resist (Psionic), +DMG(Psionic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4187174355" "You have been enchanted by the Crystal of Serafina, granting you amazing powers of the mind. You may use this power to protect those around you from psychic damage, and to add psychic damage to their attacks. You may use this power 10 times before it fades."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P106951360" "+Resist (Psionic), +Dam (Psionic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3660125145" "The Enchantment of Serafina has boosted your resistance to Psionic attacks and your own Psionic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : SC_Store_Raptor_Pack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P2188406446" "This backpack grants any person the ability to fly for a short period. If you attack a target while this pack is on, your flight speed will be temporarily reduced to Hover speed.   You have this power for 30 minutes after purchase. You can only carry 1 Raptor Pack at a time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : SC_Store_Low-G_Pack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P750844075" "The Low-G Pack allows you to leap great distances and heights, easily jumping over buildings and from rooftop to rooftop!   You have this power for 30 minutes after purchase. You can only carry 1 Low-G Pack at a time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : SC_Store_Jaunt_Initializer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P2650472338" "You can Teleport long distances. Jaunt Initializer has no recharge time, and can be reactivated without pause.   You have this power for 30 minutes after purchase. You can only carry 1 Jaunt Initializer at a time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : SC_Store_Web_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : SC_Store_Stealth_Suit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P1239181400" "Stealth Suit blends into your environment and can only be seen at very close range. If you attack while using this power, you will be discovered and lose your defense bonus. While Invisible, your movement is Slowed.   You have this power for 30 minutes after purchase. The Stealth Suit will not work with any other form of self-targeted Concealment power.  You can only carry 1 Stealth Suit at a time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : SC_Store_Stun_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : SC_Store_IR_Goggles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1095847941" "IR Goggles"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3185637534" "Toggle: Self +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P4132537714" "IR Goggles greatly improve your chances to spot stealthed or invisible players.  You have this power for 30 minutes after purchase."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1932330441" "You perception range has been increased."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : SC_Store_Cryonite_Armor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P2859365872" "As a thank you, the company has given you the opportunity to be the first to test this technology in the field.  You have this power for 30 minutes after purchase."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : SC_Store_EMP_Glove 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2906811185" "Ranged Moderate DMG(Energy), Foe -END"
// Power Help Text :
"P2653798503" "This glove can deliver a high power, focused Electromagnetic Pulse to a target. Deals good damage and can drain Endurance from the target. Very effective against machines of all types. The EMP Glove has 10 charges."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : SC_Store_Smoke_Bomb 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P75374878" "Smoke Bomb"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P1790268870" "The Smoke Bomb envelops all those in the affected area in a cloud of smoke. Most villains will not be able to see past normal melee range, although some may have better perception. If the villains are attacked, they will be alerted to your presence, but will suffer a penalty to Accuracy. You have 10 uses of the Smoke Bomb."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P152798133" "Your visual range and Accuracy have been reduced by the Smoke Bomb."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : SC_Store_Arachnos_Mace 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1285854810" "Arachnos Mace"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2703267263" "Melee, High DMG(Smash/Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2928800837" "The Arachnos Mace can cause heavy damage to targets, in addition to poisoning them.  You have this power for 30 minutes after purchase."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2318587492" "You hit {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2962390480" "{PlayerSource} Poisons you for {Damage} points of toxic damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : SC_Store_Kinetic_Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P861000631" "Toggle: Self +DEF(Smashing, Lethal, Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2888915534" "Kinetic Shield creates a harmonic Energy Aura that can deflect physical attacks.  Your Defense to Smashing and Lethal attacks is increased as weapons and powers like bullets, blades and punches tend to deflect off the shield.  The Energy based nature of Kinetic Shield also offers some minimal Defense to Energy attacks.    You have this power for 30 minutes after purchase.  Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P300263321" "You Kinetic Shield has increased your Defense to Lethal, Smashing, and to some degree, Energy attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : SC_Arachnos_Heavy_Pistol 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
