"P3881169376" "Ranged Moderate DMG(Lethal), Foe -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P3563429883" "Fires a large slug at a single target at very long range. This very accurate weapon hits hard, and can knock down foes.  It may be fired 15 times."
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : SC_Flamethrower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Help Text :
"P747552685" "This is a Flamethrower.  It sets enemies on fire.  It may do so 15 times."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1975203543" "The Flamethrower has set you on fire.  You are taking damage over time."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
