"P3023239275" "Incendiary Grenade"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2581090281" "Targeted AoE Fire, DoT(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1873013428" "This heat from this Incendiary Grenade affects all within the blast.  You have 6 grenades."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P968848735" "This explosion from this Incendiary Grenade affects all within the blast and can leave burning debris."
// Effect VictimHit Message :

