// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Warburg Launch Codes 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2650956222" "Warburg Launch Codes"
// Power Help Text :
"P3710051594" "You have 5 minutes from the time you get the Launch Code to make it to the Warburg Rocket!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hyper Stealth 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2800162969" "Hyper Stealth"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1218975169" "Toggle: Self Stealth, +DEF, -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P3666386012" "You blend into your environment and can only be seen at very close range. Even if discovered, you are hard to see and have a bonus to Defense from melee and ranged attacks. If, however, you attack while using this power, you will be discovered and will lose your Stealth and some of your Defense bonus. While Stealthy, your movement is Slowed.  Hyper Stealth has a total of 30 minutes usage time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Combat Invisibility 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1548509607" "Combat Invisibility"
// Power Help Text :
"P1943808175" "You blend into your environment and can only be seen at extremely close range. Even if discovered, you are hard to see and have a bonus to Defense from melee and ranged attacks. If, however, you attack while using this power, you will be discovered and will lose your Invisibility and some of your Defense bonus.  Combat Invisibility has a total of 30 minutes usage time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hyper Phase 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2952610040" "Hyper Phase"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P27970187" "Toggle: Self Intangible, +SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P1098137235" "You can Phase Shift to become out of sync with normal space. Although you do not become completely Invisible, you are translucent and hard to see. You are intangible, and cannot affect or be affected by those in normal space. While Hyper Phased, your run and flight speed are increased. Cannot be used with Rest.  Hyper Phase has a total of 30 minutes usage time."
// Power AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Phase Flight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2034085528" "Phase Flight"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2596392736" "Toggle: Self Fly, Intangible"
// Power Help Text :
"P335235703" "You can become ethereal which no longer binds you to the laws of normal physics. You become intangible to other entities and can fly at high speeds. Phase Flight grants some stealth and is faster than normal Flight. You cannot affect other targets while this power is active.  Phase Flight has a total of 30 minutes usage time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Raid Deploy Pylon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3695694340" "Raid Deploy Pylon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1449404963" "Create Disruptor Pylon"
// Power Help Text :
"P2318617810" "These devices create an instability in the inter-dimensional field. When several Pylons are operating at once you can redirect an Item of Power to your base.  You can build two of them, but there can only ever be one Pylon in a room at a time. Activating this power turns off all Stealth powers.  Recharge: Medium"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1162768902" "You have built a Disruptor Pylon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Brawl_Charm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3785335804" "Apprentice Charm"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1667849806" "Ranged Minor DMG(Energy), Foe -Res"
// Power Help Text :
"P3534862898" "Your magical origin has unlocked many secrets, the first of which is the ability to use this simple Apprentice Charm. This cantrip has a very short range, and deals minor Energy damage to your target, as well as lowering their resistance to further damage. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P148064655" "Your damage resistance has been reduced by the Magic Charm"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2336287629" "{PlayerSource} hits you with power from a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Brawl_Taser 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1930784112" "Taser Dart"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P288559410" "Ranged Minor DMG(Energy), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2559400391" "Being of technological origin, you have access to many little devices, one of which is a Taser Dart of your own design. This attack has a very short range and does minor Energy damage to your target. In addition it has a chance to Hold your opponent for a brief moment. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3952668655" "You are being Held by the Taser Dart"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P24579831" "{PlayerSource} electrocutes you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Brawl_Tranq 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1549075398" "Tranq Dart"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P121708253" "Ranged Minor DMG(Lethal/Toxic), Foe Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P184010444" "As a person of scientific origin you have access to many chemicals and agents. This Tranq Dart is the result of experiments you have conducted, and can be used at short range to deal minor Lethal and Toxic damage to a target. In addition there is a small chance you can put the target to Sleep with this dart, but they will wake up the next time they are damaged or healed. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1723599791" "The Tranq Dart has put you to Sleep."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P164978073" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1988363654" "{PlayerSource} hits you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1881604067" "The serum from your {PowerName} injects {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2462711592" "The Serum in the {PowerName} hurts you for {Damage} points of toxic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Brawl_Knives 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P323791697" "Throwing Knives"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P998707922" "Ranged Minor DMG(Lethal), +Minor DoT(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P450282965" "With your natural origin you have to rely on your cunning and skill. You've acquired these throwing knives as part of your personal arsenal. You can throw these knives at a very short range, and deal minor Lethal damage to your target, but a nasty wound will do additional Damage over Time. Damage: Minor (DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1511586969" "You are taking additional Damage over Time from the wound left by the Throwing Knife."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1024540372" "{PlayerSource} hits you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P775112334" "Wounds from your {PowerName} deal an additional {Damage} points of lethal damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2725623310" "Wounds from the {PowerName} deal an additional {Damage} points of lethal damage to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Brawl_Mutagen 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2475659204" "Mutagen"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3098566350" "Ranged Minor DMG(Toxic), Foe -DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P4194275725" "Being a mutant has opened the doors to many opportunities. You have recently come into possession of these capsules of genetic Mutagen. You can hurl these capsules at your enemies at very short range, where they explode on impact. They deal only minor toxic damage but the mutagen's secondary effect will lower the damage the affected target deals out. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2057008258" "Your damage has been reduced by the Mutagen."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4126232793" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P897026060" "{PlayerSource} hits you with a {PowerName} capsule for {Damage} points of toxic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Infected Anti-Serum 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P324163747" "Infected Anti-Serum"
// Power Help Text :
"P2949294760" "This dispenser is filled with an Infected Anti-Serum created by Doctor Creed.  When used on an Infected minion, it causes an explosive chemical reaction. The Anti-Serum lasts only 15 minutes before the chemicals become inert."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1316846834" "You inject {PlayerDest} with the {PowerName}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3617942190" "{PlayerSource} injects you with {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Self-Destruct 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2168834753" "Self-Destruct"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P2860671490" "Self-destruct Infected."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3540242200" "The Infected explodes in a massive blast of energy, killing himself and dealing {Damage} points of energy damage to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Demon Box 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2804599050" "Demon Box"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P73879099" "Magic Origin: Summon Wailer, Non-Magic Origin: Tar Patch"
// Power Help Text :
"P833975710" "This a small carved box made of wood stained black carved with intricate sigils, while silver hinges and clasp keep the box closed. It trembles slightly in your hand and you hear dark whispers in your mind. The Demon Box can call upon the powers of darkness to snare your foes with living darkness from the netherworld. If you are of Magic Origin, you can unleash the demonic minions within the box instead! You may call upon the power of the Demon Box three times before the wailing demons within it are drained of all their dark energies."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Arachnoid Gas 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1895074673" "Arachnoid Gas"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2780353496" "Targeted AoE Toxic"
// Power Help Text :
"P1646018615" "This gas is highly toxic, and is specifically designed to overcome Arachnoid resistances."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2876679053" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P784088428" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3409387613" "{PlayerSource} hits you with an {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Artificial Demon Seeds 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P326784725" "Artificial Demon Seeds"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3051871027" "Summon Paragon Protector"
// Power Help Text :
"P1459349223" "These unnatural seeds seem to be made of an unusually warm fleshy material. They're colored blue and gold, with the same pattern as a Paragon Protector."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frenzy Mutagen 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1254488154" "Frenzy Mutagen"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3514538919" "Self +Recharge, +DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P2193802133" "This is a metal cylinder with a biohazard symbol stenciled on it and a dermal injector on one end. It contains a special mutagen that increases your aggressiveness, allowing you to attack faster and stronger. There are 3 doses."
// Power AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Rikti Rifle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
