"P893277292" "Rikti Rifle"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1958849870" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Energy), Knockback, Stun"
// Power Help Text :
"P678753168" "The power anti-proton blast of this alien energy rifle can hurt just about anything. It has enough power for 30 shots."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2386604422" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
