"P40489725" "Essence of the Leviathan"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2006252081" "Self +DMG, -Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P2685307964" "You feel an ancient and primal power flow through you, granting you strength while at the same time consuming a part of you. You will have use of this power for 1 hour."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
