"P2836183077" "Arachnos Submachine Gun"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1563882773" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Lethal), -Def"
// Power Help Text :
"P575631523" "This is a sleek black Submachine gun used by Arachnos operatives. You can fire 10 bursts before the ammo cartridge is depleted."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2632383126" "You shoot {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and reduce their Defenses!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P119662707" "{PlayerSource} rattles you with an {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and slightly lowers your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
