"P1440983643" "Arachnos Power Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P287518923" "Toggle: Self, +Res(All DMG)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3878208608" "The Arachnos Power Shield projects a protective force field around you, giving you good damage resistance. The power cell it uses lasts 10 minutes of constant use."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3629109375" "You are now practically unstoppable!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2937554370" "Self, +Res(All DMG)"

