"P3104115092" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2221534834" "This looks like an archaic blunderbuss finished in gold with silver runes etched into its surface. It allows you to shoot blessed fire that causes tremendous damage to demonic beings. You can shoot it 10 times before it runs out of ammunition."
