// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mayhem Flight Pack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3796855982" "This backpack grants any person the ability to fly for a short period. If you attack a target while this pack is on, your flight speed will be temporarily reduced to Hover speed. You have this power for a total of 2 hours usage time. You can only carry 1 Raptor Pack at a time."

