"P2056831409" "Zero-G Pack"
// Power Help Text :
"P3938651189" "The Zero-G Pack allows you to leap great distances and heights, easily jumping over buildings and from rooftop to rooftop! The Jump Pack will last for a total of 2 hours usage time. You can only carry 1 Jump at a time."

