// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mayhem_Stealth_Suit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P312967473" "Stealth Suit blends into your environment and can only be seen at very close range. If you attack while using this power, you will be discovered and lose your defense bonus. While Invisible, your movement is Slowed.  You may use this power for a total of 30 minutes usage time. The Stealth Suit will not work with any other form of self-targeted Concealment power.  You can only carry 1 Stealth Suit at a time."

