// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hero Drop of Power 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1204670550" "Drop of Power"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3254993866" "Teammate +DMG, +ACC (Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4185307295" "Dimension Drop of Power is a special concoction created by DJ Zero to celebrate the opening of the new Pocket D. This dimensional energy can increase one's potential. In keeping with his club's theme it must be given to someone else to be effective and giving it to a Villain, Rogue, or Loyalist increases their potential to near god-like proportions! This version of Dimension Drop buffs Damage and Accuracy. Dimension Drop can only be used on teammates. You have 4 charges. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1731753980" "+DMG, +ACC"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2556996873" "You have been exposed to a Dimension Drop of Power.  Your Accuracy and Damage have been increased."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3002789462" "You slightly increase the Accuracy and Damage of {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3298684384" "{PlayerSource} slightly increases your Accuracy and Damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1601028468" "You greatly increase the Accuracy and Damage of {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2602805707" "{PlayerSource} greatly increases your Accuracy and Damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Villain Drop of Power 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P1495923835" "Dimension Drop of Power is a special concoction created by DJ Zero to celebrate the opening of the new Pocket D. This dimensional energy can increase one's potential. In keeping with his club's theme it must be given to someone else to be effective and giving it to a Hero, Vigilante or member of the Resistance increases their potential to near god-like proportions! This version of Dimension Drop buffs Damage and Accuracy. Dimension Drop can only be used on teammates. You have 4 charges. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hero Drop of Resistance 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3599685702" "Drop of Resistance"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4188843745" "Teammate +Res(All) (Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3019893538" "Dimension Drop of Resistance is a special concoction created by DJ Zero to celebrate the opening of the new Pocket D. This dimensional energy can increase one's potential. In keeping with his club's theme it must be given to someone else to be effective and giving it to a Villain, Rogue, or Loyalist increases their potential to near god-like proportions! This version of Dimension Drop buffs Damage Resistance to all damage. Dimension Drop can only be used on teammates. You have 4 charges. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P623416755" "You slightly increase the Damage Resistance of {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2739420725" "{PlayerSource} slightly increases your  Damage Resistance."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3182966104" "+Res(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P384383121" "You have been exposed to a Dimension Drop of Resistance.  Your Damage Resistance to all damage types have been increased."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Villain Drop of Resistance 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3443187857" "Dimension Drop of Resistance is a special concoction created by DJ Zero to celebrate the opening of the new Pocket D. This dimensional energy can increase one's potential. In keeping with his club's theme it must be given to someone else to be effective and giving it to a Hero, Vigilante or member of the Resistance increases their potential to near god-like proportions! This version of Dimension Drop buffs Damage Resistance to all damage. Dimension Drop can only be used on teammates. You have 4 charges. Recharge: Long"

