"P2960965119" "Drop of Vitality"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2269246306" "Teammate Heal +END"
// Power Help Text :
"P1917542522" "Dimension Drop of Vitality is a special concoction created by DJ Zero to celebrate the opening of the new Pocket D. This dimensional energy can increase one's potential. In keeping with his club's theme it must be given to someone else to be effective and giving it to a Villain, Rogue, or Loyalist increases their potential to near god-like proportions! This version of Dimension Drop Heals the target and recovers their Endurance. Dimension Drop can only be used on teammates. You have 4 charges. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P337450381" "You slightly Heal and recover some Endurance of {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2498434366" "{PlayerSource} slightly Heals you and recover some of your Endurance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Villain Drop of Vitality 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P2232371530" "Dimension Drop of Vitality is a special concoction created by DJ Zero to celebrate the opening of the new Pocket D. This dimensional energy can increase one's potential. In keeping with his club's theme it must be given to someone else to be effective and giving it to a Hero, Vigilante or member of the Resistance increases their potential to near god-like proportions! This version of Dimension Drop Heals the target and recovers their Endurance. Dimension Drop can only be used on teammates. You have 4 charges. Recharge: Long"

