"P1841618965" "Nectar"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P361720593" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Confuse, Placate"
// Power Help Text :
"P4240467585" "Eros has fashioned a version of Ambrosia from the waters of the Well of the Furies, which he as dubbed 'Nectar'. Eros' Nectar can be used up to 20 times on opponents to beguile them, effectively Placating and Confusing them. You have 20 doses. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2332288638" "Confuse, Placate"

