// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P844810460" "Orestes Rifle"
// Power Help Text :
"P2996095749" "The Orestes Rifle was created as an experimental weapon by Malta as part of their ongoing agenda to control the heroes of the world. It is designed to nullify enchantments granted by the Well of the Furies. Once removed from the power feed in Malta it will only be effective for a period of 5 hours."
// DisplayFloat :
"P315201362" "VULNERABLE"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : OBSOLETE Temporal Disruption 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P422041185" "OBSOLETE Temporal Disruption"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3682158694" "You have been affected by a temporal disruption which randomly puts you out of sync with reality. While you are out of sync you will be unable to affect or be affected by anything in the regular world."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3947861858" "You have been affected by a temporal disruption which randomly puts you out of sync with reality."

