"P3203439514" "Arachnos Disguise"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2934912060" "Toggle: Arachnos Disguise"
// Power Help Text :
"P3628520468" "This disguise should keep most Arachnos troops fooled unless you pick a fight.  It is incompatible with Granite Armor, however."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1485529780" "You have activated your Disguise."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Afterburner 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Help Text :
"P2093279074" "This Jump Pack grants you the ability to not only jump great distances, but also jump and gain altitude in mid air! The Jump Pack has limited fuel, and will be exhausted after 1 hour minutes of use."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Clockwork Connection 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2337292853" "Clockwork Connection"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2560999429" "Summon Gears"
// Power Help Text :
"P4183325109" "Penelope's strange connection to the clockwork is enough for them to help you, but only to help her. Call on them, and these Clockwork will come to your aid up to three times."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Snow Angel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P2184139005" "A guardian spirit will watch over you for the next 8 days.  If you are defeated during that time, activating this power will restore you so you may continue the battle.  The restoration blasts nearby foes with an explosion, knocking them down and Disorienting them. You will revive with about half of your Hit Points and Endurance. You will be invulnerable for a brief time, and protected from XP Debt for 20 seconds.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Golden Rings 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3615247623" "Golden Rings"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3002925638" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Energy), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P1647040964" "Although this power deals very little damage, the Golden Rings encase your foe, holding him helpless in place for a while. This power will last for 12 days. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1509604072" "You are held."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3801789812" "You burn {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Moment of Glory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3150127817" "-Regen"
// Power Help Text :
"P139947053" "When you activate this power, you lose almost all of your Hit Points and can no longer Regenerate Hit Points, However, you gain Resistant and Defense to all damage types except Psionics, recover Endurance more quickly, and are highly resistant to Sleep, Disorient, Immobilization, and Hold effects. After Moment of Glory wares off, you will not be able to Regenerate Hit Points for a short while. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3602074806" "You lose most of your Hit Points, but are now practically invincible."
// DisplayPowerDefenseFloat :

