// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power of the Thorn 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3072034135" "Power of the Thorn"
// Power Help Text :
"P3034554692" "The Power of the Thorn Tree has many uses. Villains use the stolen energy to re-shape their powers, but it could also be used to breach Dr. Aeon's defenses. However, the power is unstable, and you'll only have 5 hours before it dissipates."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
