// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P4246502835" "You have a Consignment House Transport beacon.  It will allow you instant transport to the local Consignment House from any location.  Note that this ability may only be used once every 30 minutes.  You may only own one Consignment House Transporter at a time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
