// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1452108065" "Nectanebo's Curse Breaker"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1708142469" "Self: Remove Curse"
// Power Help Text :
"P3100978835" "Nectanebo's Curse Breaker can be used to strip the effects of the Curse of Weariness from you.  It may be used 5 times before fading."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Vanguard Psi-Bomb 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2186443100" "Vanguard Psi-Bomb"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1228957318" "Ranged Extreme AoE (Psionic), Stun, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1616867996" "The Vanguard Psi-Bomb cause an extreme amount of psionic damage in a 25' radius from it's point of impact.  The Psi-Bomb will disorient most targets.  It is particularly effective against Rikti, however, as the psionic shriek overloads their psi receptors, which can cause a great deal of confusion in their ranks.  You initially are given three Bombs."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1134568064" "Confused, Stunned"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1821948611" "You are stunned and possibly confused."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P670859590" "Your {PowerName} screeches within the mind of {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of psionic damage and Slows his attack speed!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3533216945" "{PlayerSource} assaults your mind with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of psionic damage!"

