"P3561842542" "Auto: Travel Suppression"
// Power Help Text :
"P4159551644" "You have attacked or been attacked by another player, resulting in your Travel Powers being suppressed.  The duration of suppression is based on what caused it, ranging from 2 seconds from being attacked to 3 times the "damage scale" of the power used to attack."

