"P1792897793" "Your experience within Paragon City or Rogue Isles has earned you the right to give you a boost to Patrol XP.  When this power is used, you will gain half a level of Patrol XP, however you can only ever have 1 level worth of Patrol XP at a time.  NOTE: Any Patrol XP granted through this power beyond the one level limit will be lost.  This power has 5 charges."

