"P1615947859" "You can shift yourself into the Ethereal Plane. Although you do not become completely Invisible, you are translucent and hard to see. You are intangible, and cannot affect or be affected by those in normal space. Once activated, you will remain shifted for 30 seconds.  You cannot rest on the Ethereal Plane.  You may use this ability five times."
