"P516610214" "Self, +Def(Smash, Lethal), +Res(Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2845413698" "This device will reduce the likelihood that you will be struck by smashing or lethal attacks as well as reducing the damage that incoming energy attacks.  Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : The Perfect Eye 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2919505575" "The Perfect Eye"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1135137309" "+Perception, +ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P1488764232" "You have gazed into the unblinking guardian of Rularuu's cathedral and gained power from it's influence. Your gaze pierces darkness and even dimensions. Your Stealth Detection and Accuracy are both increased.  Duration: 7 days (Real time)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : The True Furnace 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3195497801" "The True Furnace"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P430179581" "+Max End, Res(End Drain)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4157567333" "You have bathed in the heat of the True Furnace which Rularuu used to construct his inter-dimensional factory cubes. The True Furnace radiates energy, which has greatly increased your endurance reserves. Duration: 7 days (Real time)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Heart of a Storm Elemental 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P606920834" "Heart of a Storm Elemental"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1109217275" "+Max HP, +Regen"
// Power Help Text :
"P2555379624" "You have released the still beating Heart of Daralak, a mighty brute. The Heart increases the health and regeneration of those exposed to it's unique energies. Duration: 7 days (Real time)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Anger Monument 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P334556905" "Anger Monument"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3937184860" "Enhances Damage"
// Power Help Text :
"P1186716149" "Viewing the Anger Monument filled you with rage and power. Your damage of all types is increased. Duration: 7 days (Real time)"

