// Power Help Text :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fortune The Fool 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3464118493" "The Fool"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2378059513" "-To Hit, +Movement Rate, +Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P1801445900" "Your fortune: The Fool.  The Fool is a traveler, blissfully unaware of their surroundings and charging headlong into destiny.  This fortune stands for Thoughtlessness, Folly and Frivolity.  Your To Hit has been slightly reduced, however your Movement rate and Recharge rate have improved."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2059988704" "You have been granted the fortune of The Fool"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fortune The Magician 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3178469822" "The Magician"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2148985152" "+Status effects, +Debuff, +DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P3419047795" "Your fortune: The Magician.  The Magician is a scholar, wise in the ways of the world around him.  The Magician stands for Creativity, Spontaneity, and Self reliance.  All your damage powers and Control powers, including holds, immobilizes, stuns, sleeps, fears, and confuses have increased in duration.  Also, all your Defense Debuffs, Speed Debuffs, and To Hit debuffs are increased. Additionally, any Speed buffs, To Hit buffs, and all Endurance modifying powers are also increased."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1982558727" "You have been granted the fortune of The Magician"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fortune The Lovers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1422728521" "The Lovers"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2005521434" "+Regen, +Recovery, +Buff Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3128578204" "Your fortune: The Lovers.  The Lovers symbolize Love, Beauty, and Harmony.  Your Regeneration and Recovery rate have been boosted.  Also, all your Heals, Hit point boosters, Regeneration powers, and Recovery powers are increased in effectiveness. Additionally, any regeneration debuffs and recovery debuffs are also increased"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P256602026" "You have been granted the fortune of The Lovers"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fortune The Hermit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P869261096" "The Hermit"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1757721942" "+Acc, +Perception, +Def(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2740492033" "Your fortune: The Hermit.  The Hermit stands vigilant and alone, wary of deception and trickery.  The Hermit stands for Vigilance, Caution and withdrawal.  Your Accuracy, Perception and Defense have all been increased."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1749659083" "You have been granted the fortune of The Hermit"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fortune Wheel of Fortune 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1065554207" "Wheel of Fortune"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2486827269" "+Resist, +Defense"
// Power Help Text :
"P2964029932" "Your fortune: the Wheel of Fortune.  The Wheel of Fortune guides the fate of everyone, and brings the blessings of luck.  The Wheel of Fortune symbolizes Destiny, Advancement, and Fate.  Your Resistance and Defense to all attacks has been increased."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2224743210" "You have been granted the fortune of Wheel of Fortune"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fortune Death 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1308031328" "Death"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4220216460" "+Damage, +Recharge, +Debuff Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2674987038" "Your fortune: Death.  Death brings the end of one chapter of a story, and transforms into the beginning of the next.  Death symbolizes Transformation, Change and Loss.  The Damage and Recharge rate of your powers has improved.  Also, all your Defense Debuffs, Speed Debuffs, and To Hit debuffs are increased. Additionally, any Speed buffs, To Hit buffs, and all Endurance modifying powers are also increased."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2744604696" "You have been granted the fortune of Death."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fortune The Tower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1299359447" "The Tower"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1805540260" "Damage (Self), +Damage(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2993305578" "Your fortune: The Tower.  The Tower once symbolized the might and pride of an entire nation, until it was destroyed by powers beyond the comprehension of humanity.  The Tower symbolizes Catastrophe, Misery and loss of stability.   When this fortune is granted, you will take some damage, however, the Damage of all your powers will be increased."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P363747432" "You have been granted the fortune of The Tower"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fortune The Tower Buff 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fortune The Moon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4151682800" "The Moon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1830828" "+Status Effect, +Debuff Special, +Def (All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1613223726" "Your fortune: The Moon.  The original master of the night, The Moon shines as a warning against the deception, mystery and danger in the dark of night. All your control powers, including holds, immobilizes, stuns, sleeps, fears, and confuses have increased in duration.  Also, all your Defense Debuffs, Speed Debuffs, and To Hit debuffs are increased. Additionally, any Speed buffs, To Hit buffs, and all Endurance modifying powers are also increased.  Being vigilant increases your defense to all attacks."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1137117389" "You have been granted the fortune of The Moon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fortune The Sun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3372849643" "The Sun"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2160026439" "+Resist, +DMGAll), +Buff Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P866308725" "Your fortune: The Sun.  The power of The Sun brings strength and life, symbolizing accomplishment, joy and sincerity.  Your Damage and Resistance to damage have been increased.  Also, all your Heals, Hit point boosters, Regeneration powers, and Recovery powers are increased in effectiveness. Additionally, any regeneration debuffs and recovery debuffs are also increased"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1880724247" "You have been granted the fortune of The Sun"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
