"P4231482119" "Mutation: Pain Tolerance"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P495567194" "End Reduction, +Regen, +Res(Status)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2031304471" "Due to a (hopefully) temporary mutation, you have become remarkably resistant to pain.  You heal a bit faster, tire more slowly and status effects wear off faster, as well."

