"P2231994764" "When this power runs out of time, it will grant the user the Fear Incarnate power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : GrantRogueAlignmentPower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3035202417" "Countdown to Duplicity"
// Power Help Text :
"P4200966243" "When this power runs out of time, it will grant the user the Duplicity power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : GrantVillainAlignmentPower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P39193205" "Countdown to Frenzy"
// Power Help Text :
"P2687069916" "When this power runs out of time, it will grant the user the Frenzy power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : GRHeroAlignmentPower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1924267531" "Call to Justice"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P985805731" "PBAoE, Allies +DMG, +To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P745912866" "You inspire your nearby allies to bring justice to your foes. Using this power will moderately increase the damage and to hit of yourself and all nearby allies. Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2816041539" "You inspire your nearby allies boosting their damage and to hit chance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : GRVigilanteAlignmentPower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2284540599" "Fear Incarnate"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2056849591" "PBAoE, Foe Terrorize, -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P243297195" "You strike fear into the hearts of the guilty causing all nearby foes to tremble in fear for a short time.  Fear Incarnate will only affect Minion and Underling class enemies.  Affected foes will also have their To Hit chance reduced. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3886988492" "Terrorized"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1348502372" "You are Terrorized!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4228622704" "You Terrorize {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} and reduce their chance to hit."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3149926538" "{PlayerSource} terrorizes you with {PowerName} and reduces your chance to hit!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : GRRogueAlignmentPower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2326007375" "Duplicity"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1111895396" "PBAoE, Foe Confuse, -Damage"
// Power Help Text :
"P1706774132" "You trick nearby enemies causing weaker enemies like minions to become confused for a short time. Affected foes will also have their Damage output decreased. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P257850452" "You have been confused!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3959709718" "You Confuse {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} and reduce their damage slightly."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2662206680" "{PlayerDest} confuses you with their {PowerName} and reduces your damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : GRVillainAlignmentPower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1500070530" "Frenzy"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3393912398" "Self +Recharge, +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2371917884" "You drive yourself into a blind rage to strike down your foes! Upon activating this power you will increase your recharge rate. All Hero Archetypes, Masterminds, Corruptors and Soldiers of Arachnos will receive a high damage increase, Dominators will have their Domination bar filled, Brutes will have their Rage bar filled and Stalkers will be put into a hidden state and receive a minor damage buff. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Resistance HE Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P127542854" "Resistance HE Grenade"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3505820876" "Targeted AoE, Moderate DMG(Lethal/Smashing), Minor DoT(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1293676428" "This grenade is built from stolen Resistance munitions. It should send an effective message."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2926425017" "Minor DoT(Fire)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3009432464" "You are continuing to burn from the fire."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Bruised 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2079075448" "Bruised"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4290155161" "-Res (all)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2390873058" "You have been bruised and your resistance to damage has been lowered."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Pacification Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2097226501" "Pacification Grenade"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3834876086" "Weaken Marauder"
// Power Help Text :
"P161002293" "This Electromagnetic Pulse Disruption Device, colloquially known as a Pacification Grenade, is part of a batch specially whipped up by Emperor Cole in case Praetor White ever got out of hand and had to be put down. Using this grenade on Praetor White (aka, Marauder) will severely lower his defenses for 45 seconds."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3034647437" "Marauder pacified and weakened!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dissolving Acid 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P942906873" "Molecular Acid"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2495989700" "Destroy Reinforcement Door"
// Power Help Text :
"P2636417326" "This powerful molecular acid has a wide variety of military-industrial applications, but its most immediate use is to disable the Reinforcement Doors within Lambda Sector with a single application. Disabling these doors prevents Praetor White's IDF reinforcements from using that access point to join the fray."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P658933923" "Reinforcement Door dissolved!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Glowing Lichen 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1912002571" "Glowing Lichen"
// Power Help Text :
"P2067370352" "This is some of the strange Devouring Earth lichen found in the Underground following their arrival - what strange effect does it have on the War Works?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chain Gun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P193312026" "Chain Gun"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3694738782" "Ranged Lethal, High Dam, +Acc"
// Power Help Text :
"P2823559604" "Sprays a massive burst of lead at a target.  Lots of damage and a bonus to hit, but slow to reload."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2612505029" "{PlayerSource} shreds you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : All Phases 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3241883456" "All Phases"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Police Drone Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2541158994" "Police Drone Recharge"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1171507453" "Recharge Police Drone"
// Power Help Text :
"P80037905" "Restores a Police Drone and recharges its TransLocation Beam."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : ZE Molotov 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P675900933" "Molotov Cocktail"
// Power Help Text :
"P127450264" "These Molotov Cocktails are fashioned from advanced Praetorian plasma fuels and can burn for quite some time independent of any other fuel source. These were taken from participants in a protest against Emperor Cole in Nova Praetoria."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3582546467" "The explosion from the Fire Bomb affects all within the blast and sets them on fire."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3922669339" "You hit {PlayerTarget} with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of fire damage and start a fire!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3159188314" "{PlayerSource} hits you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of fire damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : ZE Katana 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P957033269" "Melee (Cone), Superior DMG(Lethal), Foe -DEF(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P749198281" "These Syndicate blades were animated by their Telekineticists to strike on behalf of the wielder, even if they have no skill with the blade. They were confiscated from the Syndicate Takedown in Imperial City. Eventually, though, the animated effect will expire."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2076346076" "Your defense has been reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2054502733" "You cut at {PlayerTarget} with the {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Juggernaut End Offense 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2135474955" "Juggernaut End Offense"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Juggernaut End Defense 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4225492319" "Juggernaut End Defense"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Juggernaut End Standard 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3412877377" "Juggernaut End Standard"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power Cell 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1803890574" "Power Cell"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P690677664" "Magnetic Containment Power Cell"
// Power Help Text :
"P343869041" "This power cell must be installed in the Containment System Terminals scattered around the reactor in order to restore the integrity of the system and override Antimatter's control. Each Containment System Terminal requires three Power Cells to be fully capable of generating the magnetic field needed to assert control over the system."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1794324015" "You have installed a {PowerName} in the Containment System Terminal."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4160618588" "You have installed a second {PowerName} in the Containment System Terminal."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2780381940" "You have installed the last {PowerName} required in the Containment System Terminal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disintegrated 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4234719348" "Disintegrated"
// Power Help Text :
"P1014613474" "Anti-Matter's disintegration power will heal him if you die while under its effect."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3095178063" "You have been {PowerName}. A portion of your matter is returned to Anti-Matter, healing him for {Damage} points of damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : EntangledInteractA 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3604825157" "Beta Interaction"
// Power Help Text :
"P2412865158" "You are Alpha Entangled. Coming into contact with a Beta Entangled ally will cause damage and reduce regeneration, recovery and defense for as long as contact is maintained."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1105086760" "DoT(Energy), -REG, -REC, -DEF"
