"P1937283575" "Accolades"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1104476264" "Accolades are powers that are granted as rewards for earning Badges."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : The Atlas Medallion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2885204686" "The Atlas Medallion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P666944822" "+Max END"
// Power Help Text :
"P3205247806" "Earning The Atlas Medallion has granted you a permanent increase of +5 to your Max Endurance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Super Patriot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P906024617" "Super Patriot"
// Power Help Text :
"P2707747326" "As a Super Patriot, you have been granted a permanent increase to your Max Endurance by 5%%."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Freedom Phalanx Reserve 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1041163101" "Freedom Phalanx Reserve"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2186260285" "+Max HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P94584379" "Earning Membership into the Freedom Phalanx Reserve has granted you a permanent increase to your Max Hit Points by 10%%."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Task Force Commander 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P621757626" "Task Force Commander"
// Power Help Text :
"P3399246998" "As a Task Force Commander, you have been granted a permanent increase to your Max Hit Points by 5%%."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Portal Jockey 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4023825941" "Portal Jockey"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P1443249932" "As a Portal Jockey, you have been granted you a permanent increase to your Max Hit Points and Max Endurance by 5%%."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Crey CBX-9 Pistol 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1211054765" "Crey CBX-9 Pistol"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P957931225" "The Crey CBX-9 Pistol Immobilizes your target in an icy trap. Deals some damage over time and slightly Slows the target's attack and movement speed even if they break free from the Immobilization. The Crey Cryo Pistol is extremely accurate, but it can only fire once every 25 minutes."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4260318277" "The Crey CBX-9 Pistol has frozen you and may leave you Immobilized.  It has reduced your Attack speed and Running speed."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1242975880" "Your Cryo Pistol freezes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of cold damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P378872091" "{PlayerSource} freezes you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of cold damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Eye of the Magus 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1527683252" "Eye of the Magus"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1162854115" "Self, +Res(All but Psionics), +DEF(All but Psionics)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3837125652" "When you activate the Eye of the Magus, you are granted a very high bonus to Defense and Damage Resistance for one minute.  You can only activate the Eye of the Magus once every 25 minutes."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2889846287" "The Eye of the Magus has significantly boosted your Defense and Damage Resistance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Vanguard Medal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1935960364" "Vanguard Medal"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P561961308" "When activated, your Vanguard Medal will increase the duration of all your Disorient, Hold, Immobilize, Fear, Confuse and Sleep powers for a short time. Knockback distance is also increased. The effect of this boost will last for 1 minute. You can only activate the Vanguard Medal once every 25 minutes."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1227564472" "You tap into the power of the Vanguard Medal. The duration of all your control effects will be doubled for the next minute."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Geas of the Kind Ones 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P60758833" "Geas of the Kind Ones"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P259622302" "Self +Recovery, +ACC, +Recharge, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P3997499605" "You have uncovered the secrets of Croatoa and have been awarded the Geas of the Kind Ones. Like most supernatural gifts, the Geas is both a blessing and a curse. By using it you can greatly increase your recharge speed, Endurance recovery, and Accuracy for 1 minute. However, your Defense will be severely reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4180699681" "You feel the blessing of the Kind Ones enter you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Marshall 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4289087208" "Marshal"
// Power Help Text :
"P1180671786" "You've been awarded the title of Marshal for your service to Arachnos. This has given you a 5%% increase to Endurance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : High Pain Threshold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2472637382" "High Pain Threshold"
// Power Help Text :
"P3366959610" "You've got an incredibly High Pain Threshold, an after effect of which is that your Hit Points are 10%"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Born In Battle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P8087965" "Born In Battle"
// Power Help Text :
"P2336616937" "You've proved yourself as Born in Battle, adding 5% to both your Endurance and Hit Point totals."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stolen Immobilizer Ray 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4223994762" "Stolen Immobilizer Ray"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4047840114" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Energy), Foe Immobilize, -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P539889918" "In your crime spree you have acquired an Immobilizer Ray. You're not sure where it came from, but it sure is useful stopping foes in their tracks."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1161698664" "The Immobilizer Ray has frozen you and may leave you Immobilized.  It has reduced your Attack speed and Running speed."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4143091052" "Your Immobilizer Ray blasts {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of cold damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2209118531" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of cold damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Demonic Aura 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P204506937" "Demonic Aura"
// Power Help Text :
"P689877540" "The spirit of a demon resides within you. Bringing it to the surface of your mind can make you highly resistant to all types of damage for a short time. You mustn't let the demon inside you out for too long, however, or it just may cost you your mortal soul."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1027495278" "The Demonic Aura has significantly boosted your Defense and Damage Resistance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Megalomaniac 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1385763327" "Megalomaniac"
// Power Help Text :
"P1386505250" "You've wanted more control and now you have it. Activating this power increases the power of all of your Sleeps, Holds, Immobilize, and Confuse for 60 seconds. You can only activate it once every 25 minutes."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1922760034" "You have drawn on your iron will to increase the duration of all your control effects will be doubled for the next minute."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Invader 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1649862905" "Invader"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Force of Nature 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1400119757" "Force of Nature"
// Power Help Text :
"P629448849" "You have shown yourself as a true Force of Nature, and been bestowed with the fury of the elements. Like most supernatural gifts, the Force of Nature is both a blessing and a curse. By using it you can greatly increase your recharge speed, Endurance recovery, and Accuracy for 1 minute. However, your Defense will be severely reduced."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P18370402" "You are infused with the power of the Elements."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Iron Man 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Help Text :
"P1813200685" "You are a true Iron Man.  You persistence and stamina have resulted in your Max Hit Points and Max Endurance increasing by 10%%."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Portable Workbench 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P143196985" "Portable Workbench"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P204349393" "Summon Portable Workbench"
// Power Help Text :
"P4261343159" "You can use this power to summon a portable worktable.  It will follow you and your team mates to craft recipes while 'in the field' instead of needing to return to your base or to the university to do so.  It can be used once per hour and lasts for 5 minutes each time it is summoned.  You may not summon the Portable Workbench in PVP enabled areas."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : RIWE_Accolade_Power 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P380162039" "Elusive Mind"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P936340276" "Moderate Psionic Resistance"
// Power Help Text :
"P2523173734" "You have gained the ability to deflect and protect yourself from mental invasions of all sorts.  By focusing your mind using this technique, you gain strong defense against Psionic attacks and are moderately resistant to Psionic damage while this power is active.  It lasts for 60 seconds per use.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1333416907" "By focusing your mind using this technique, you gain strong defense against Psionic attacks and are moderately resistant to Psionic damage for 60 seconds."

