"P2759500267" "Auto: Recipe Bonus"
// Power Help Text :
"P1525816128" "Due to your training with Ouroboros you will receive a chance to gain an invention recipe upon mission completion for as long as this effect has time remaining."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
